  {
    "place_id": "ChIJSU2qLbcEmogRsJwBQpAN04U",
    "name": "The Hangout",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "101 E Beach Blvd, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-948-3030",
    "website": "https://www.thehangout.com/hangout-gulf-shores/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9643066140364217520",
    "lat": 30.2481175,
    "lng": -87.68921519999999,
    "plus_code": "68X6+68 Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 31162,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Deidre Knapp",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a cool place!  It uses unique items as part of their decor!  The way burger, fries & Gouda grits & sweet tea  were excellent.  My server, Shay was friendly, professional and attentive.  She recommended a signature sauce to use for my fries.  Delish!  I sat on their deck and was able to enjoy a little more of the beach from a different perspective!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "R A",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "My family and I ate here on a Friday evening, around 7 PM, November 28, 2025. They were not very busy. We were seated pretty quickly. Our server Ava was fairly quick to show up and take our order. We got our drinks quickly. After that, we didn't see her again until someone else delivered our food to us. She asked us how things looked, and kept on walking. I ordered the Redfish, my daughter ordered a double order of crab legs, and my wife got a hamburger (Boring!). We also had the BBQ Nachos, whi",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Madison Neal",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Visited Hangout in the “off season” and had a great experience. Food came out quickly and was fabulous. I recommend the redfish and shrimp and grits. Our waitress Mauve was excellent. Restaurant was clean with a good atmosphere on the front patio.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kimeisha C.",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had such a great experience at The Hangout on the Beach in Gulf Shores! Our waiter, TJ, was absolutely amazing—friendly, kind, funny, and very informative. His menu suggestions were spot on, and he made the whole experience even better. I truly wish him and his fiancée nothing but the best in their future endeavors.\n\nThe overall vibe of the restaurant was awesome—fun, energetic, and welcoming. I loved seeing the staff and birthday guests dancing on the tables, which made the atmosphere feel li",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ashley Lawson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time going to the Hangout to have dinner yesterday evening and it was phenomenal! Ricky made our experience absolutely fantastic! Extremely tentative and kept us laughing the whole time just making sure we had everything we needed as well a great time! 100/10 rating! Will certainly go back every year we come to Orange Beach. Our kids loved being here and it was such a great experience.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
