    "place_id": "ChIJg9iMWsUEmogRLBWxscU8kF0",
    "name": "Subway",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "170 Fort Morgan Road, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-968-8288",
    "website": "https://restaurants.subway.com/united-states/al/gulf-shores/170-ft-morgan-rd?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=35514&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTU4NzYtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6741955461961028908",
    "lat": 30.2670198,
    "lng": -87.6868147,
    "plus_code": "7887+R7 Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 2,
    "reviews_count": 78,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Zach R.",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I'm not stupid enough to eat Subway's subs, but I thought they at least couldn't screw up an Icee. Wrong! Not only did they put it in a regular cup (which holds less than the dedicated Icee cups), the stingy guy didn't even fill it all the way up. For the privilege I paid over $4, nearly twice as much as the Subway in Walmart in Robertsdale charges.\n\nTo top it off, the employee never once smiled, said thank you or anything else.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Koraya Astreia",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Grossed out by the location across the street, I tried here and found the same problems.\n\nEmployees were not following Subway sanitation standards and best practices by:\n\n-- not wearing head/hair coverings\n-- not washing their hands thoroughly before making a sandwich\n-- accepting payment with gloves on and them going back to making sandwiches without changing their gloves\n-- taking off one glove to accept payment and then instead of washing hands and getting new gloves they simply slipped the g",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "stacy coate",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "First trip into Subway in years...it was dissapointing all the way around. Employees are not friendly...the toppings are sparse...little flavor and pricey. Definitely not the same as it used to be. One and done for me.",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bala Natarajan",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I want to give negative rating but there is no way for that. Worst subs ever I had. The staffs are rude.",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Taylor Suggs",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "This used to be a great location a long time ago, but since management changed it has gone down the drain with it's customer service.\n\nToday, I went in to order and the woman who was serving me was rude the whole time. First, she was getting hasty with me and was rushing me with choosing my order less than a few seconds of me coming to the counter. She was also talking WAY too fast for me to even understand her. I politely asked her to repeat herself a couple of times, but she acted annoyed each",
        "time": "8 years ago"
      }
    ],
