  {
    "place_id": "ChIJR1bZlp8HmogRL_gXPHvSRUM",
    "name": "Gulf Shores Steamer",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "27267 Perdido Beach Blvd #115, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-948-6344",
    "website": "http://www.gulfshoressteamer.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=4847512000665221167",
    "lat": 30.276469,
    "lng": -87.5599587,
    "plus_code": "7CGR+H2 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 1555,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Craig Bishop",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We sat outside next to some fishing boats docked at the pier. Very nice atmosphere. Service was fast and the server was able to answer questions and make suggestions. I ordered the grilled yellow fin tuna special with shrimp and my wife ordered the steamed royal reds bucket for one (1 1/2 lbs.). Both entrees were absolutely delicious and perfectly cooked. It is definitely on our list to return as a favorite!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Michael Sanders",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Good Grub.  I had the grilled grouper po boy and she had the chicken bowl.  The grouper was outstanding.  Very flavorful and moist. The wife enjoyed the chicken bowl.  We split a piece of key Lime pie...a little too sweet,  but was still very good.  We walked from the Perdido Beach Resort....was right across the street.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Schwingschwa",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We were really looking for good crab legs while down in gulf shores. This place was everything we were looking for. Everything from the location, service and the food was perfect.\n\nWe both decided to go with the crab boil that came with 2 crab leg groups, corn, potatoes, and gumbo for $40 at the time of writing this.\n\nOur server was Paige I believe and she did fantastic! She took care of everything we needed. Was attentive without being over checking and we never wanted for anything.\n\nAll the cr",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kay",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Delicious, flavorful seafood with filling portion sizes!! We got here close to closing time but the staff were happy to serve us and the service was top notch!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Susan Heath",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love that the patio (four tables) was dog friendly.  Food was delicious, atmosphere beautiful with the boats from the marina and our server was awesome.   Gumbo, stuffed shrimp, royal reds and tuna a must!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      }
    ],
