  {
    "place_id": "ChIJt5WsAUQFmogR-4RcQYxem7o",
    "name": "Mikato Japanese Restaurant",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "3800 Gulf Shores Pkwy Suite 200, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-968-2525",
    "website": "http://mikatojapanese.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13446445068929762555",
    "lat": 30.30178849999999,
    "lng": -87.6801803,
    "plus_code": "8829+PW Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 3.9,
    "reviews_count": 755,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Daneen England",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great food, very good prices and fantastic sushi! Would be back!\nGood edamame, not super big order though\nGood seaweed salad (I like ours in Georgia Better cuz comes with thinly sliced cucumbers!!). Theirs came on top of some romaine lettuce\nHad to ask waitress few times for items already asked for (extra ginger, yum yum sauce)… host was little slow getting back to post ,\nOverall good experience and would come back.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Meme Henry",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Don't think I've ever had a bad experience at any Hibachi restaurant, and this one is no exception.\n\nGreeted well at the door, prompt to be seated.\n\nAmbiance and decor remained with the theme.\n\nOur server forgot and missed a few things but not too terrible.\n\nOur cook/chef had fun right along with us.\n\nFood was perfectly seasoned.\nThe serving was so much, I had to split it but definitely not complaining, lol.\n\nIf I were in the area again, I'd visit this establishment again.",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Scott Leising",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Perfect experience.  Sushi roll was superb.  Food was very delicious.  Atmosphere is very nice.  Service was efficient and friendly.  We had a regular table and drinks, will return for a seat at a hibachi table!",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brittany Horton",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Food was decent but be aware if you’re here on business, I’d skip. I explained to the server that I’d need and itemized receipt prior to ordering. Card was ran and no itemized receipt. Spoke with lady at register and given one, but no items listed. Just ‘food’ and the cost. Asked if I could take a paper sushi menu and was told no, they don’t leave the restaurant and was told to take a picture. Extremely rude! I spend $60 and couldn’t even take a paper menu. My server was Lauren and she was very ",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "J L",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Service was hands down the absolute worst that I’ve ever experienced in my 38 years of life. Absolutely horrible. The owner sat two tables of people that came in after my family of 3. Intentionally. When I spoke up he sat us down. On a corner. Upon which we waited a solid 25 minutes until another couple sat down and then the waitress decided to speak to us. Another 45 minutes later and we finally got our drinks. But they left our child’s drink out. He sat there waiting for a drink for over an ho",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
