  {
    "place_id": "ChIJT238K9AEmogRJyHb-s3AI4U",
    "name": "Subway",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "1545 Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-968-5024",
    "website": "https://restaurants.subway.com/united-states/al/gulf-shores/1545-gulfshore-pky?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=3988&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTg5MDYtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9593723622138781991",
    "lat": 30.26655639999999,
    "lng": -87.69006999999999,
    "plus_code": "7885+JX Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 3.1,
    "reviews_count": 149,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Eddie Moore",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Only 1 worker that only used one set of gloves, going between making my sandwich, baking bread, and going back and forth to toaster oven.\n\nThen the men's bathroom. I'll attach pics but the smell is what was even worse.",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nathan C",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Garbage! Worst Subway I’ve ever eaten at. Look at the quality of our sandwiches! Terrible customer service! Terrible sandwiches!",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Eric Daily",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Under new management a couple of years ago ,  this Subway is the best on the island.  period! They take their time and get it right.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Koraya Astreia",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Recently visited here and left because employees were not following Subway sanitation standards and best practices by:\n\n-- not wearing head/hair coverings\n-- not washing their hands thoroughly before making a sandwich\n-- accepting payment with gloves on and them going back to making sandwiches without changing their gloves\n-- taking off one glove to accept payment and then instead of washing hands and getting new gloves they simply slipped the glove back on and continued making sandwiches\n-- tou",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Angela Wingard",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "There is a new couple that owns this subway and they are so wonderful! You can tell that they put their heart and soul into this Restaurant. The bread and veggies Are always so fresh. Compared to the other subways That are around, This is buy far the best one!",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
