  {
    "place_id": "ChIJtTfoJKIHmogRpqJshg7e1g0",
    "name": "Tacky Jacks Orange Beach",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "27206 Safe Harbor Dr, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-4144",
    "website": "http://tackyjacks.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=997228521475318438",
    "lat": 30.2811185,
    "lng": -87.56097489999999,
    "plus_code": "7CJQ+CJ Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 7975,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Kassidy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I didn't get any photos of our food, but it was plenty & filling! I didn't catch our server's name but he was polite and attentive! Food was a bit pricey but was a nice treat for a late dinner :). My fiancé got a firecracker fried shrimp poboy with a side of hush puppies and it was so large he couldn't finish it all! And I got a fried chicken wrap with the firecracker sauce added to it, alongside boiled corn on the cob 😋 Plus our daiquiris were phenomenal, the perfect mix for sweet & alcoholic. ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tj Mathias",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Catch of the day sandwich was great! Some tasty fries and great sweet tea. The beignets are really good. The service was friendly and the atmosphere was fantastic. Fun gift shop too!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "MarStar",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Awesome, awesome place. John was our servicer today. He was polite and kind and patient when I couldn't decide what to eat. He was very knowledgeable of the menu. The entire atmosphere and scenery was calming and very unique to the area. The food was amazing. I look forward to going back one day. The gift shop also has some GREAT items in there. The funny magnets and signs had us dying laughing",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Cindy Wakefield",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "One of our favorite breakfast spots in orange beach. We’ve been coming here for years. The view is incredible and the food and drinks are a great match. I’ve had multiple menu items and the pancakes are my favorite - fluffy and light. Our server Abbey was great. Overall, it’s always a wonderful experience.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "jerry browning",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great view of the bay, nice setting, great atmosphere. Attentive staff. Variety of entree selections, all that we ate were exceptionally very tasty. We tried Breakfast once, and Lunch another time: both times were good food, and very enjoyable.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      }
    ],
