  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ55i9UUQGmogRkCe6uzJgenE",
    "name": "Cosmo's Restaurant & Bar",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25753 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-948-9663",
    "website": "http://www.cosmosrestaurantandbar.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8176953844458727312",
    "lat": 30.2914363,
    "lng": -87.5858878,
    "plus_code": "7CR7+HJ Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 3011,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Deepak Rao",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "We remember this to be a fine restaurant in past years. However we were disappointed with our lunch specials today. The shrimp in the shrimp ettouffee were the tiniest we have ever seen! Also very few and far between!!!\n\nThe Tuna Poke bowl had a reasonable amount of tuna. However an excessive portion of rice and almost no greens or veggies in it!!\n\nThe side salad (forgot to take pic) was pretty decent, no complaints.\n\nSo overall we were disappointed with our lunch specials today. The service how",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Thomas Hodges",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Sea Bass a very unique dish worth trying but overall, it was a disappointing food experience. This was not a service issue; our waitress was amazing. She went over the specials and we always had drinks promptly. This was more of a just kinda boring issue. Now, since I’m being critical, I will say the Sea Bass was a unique dish worth trying. So, if you’re here and have to try something, I’d give the Sea Bass a go… good flavor and very unique dish. That being said, I love crab claws, get them almo",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Marialexandraa Ochoa",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Oh my goodness! For starters what an eventful establishment. All kinds of Stores and beautiful covered patio. We had dinner on a Tuesday night and they were packed. Lee was top notch in hospitality. She was working so many tables and still delivered great service. THE FOOD WAS AMAZING. I feel like these pictures lack the wonderful balanced flavors. The seafood was so fresh and the steak as tender as they get. Get the fire cracker shrimp!!!!!!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "D Lo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Had lunch here today.  Four dollar Bloody Mary’s, app was was bang bang shrimp huge portion.Blackened salmon with mashed potatoes and perfectly steamed veggies.  We also got the fried chicken Cobb salad.  Everything was delicious and our server Olivia was amazing.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tina Linder",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Best place we ate during this vacation by far! The live music was good. The waitress took her time with my parents who are older and hard of hearing. The cute little shops were a nice touch. The clothing boutique was very proud of their items and they were way too expensive, so we didn't buy anything, but the stuff was cute. The food was fresh, delivers quickly, cooked well, and delicious!",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      }
    ],
