  {
    "place_id": "ChIJm_UOO3yvkIgRheTqlhL19Rc",
    "name": "Fisherman's Corner",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "13486 Perdido Key Dr, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-791-6914",
    "website": "https://www.fishermanscornerrestaurant.net/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1726555492356646021",
    "lat": 30.314445,
    "lng": -87.426425,
    "plus_code": "8H7F+QC Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 2583,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Latara Moore",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an amazing time here. Mr. Jesse our server was amazing. He gave us several options and was very attentive. The food choices were amazing! I evened everything from our appetizers (sons first time trying frog legs was a positive experience), to our entrees, they were all amazing! I would urge you to come and try it for yourself!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Cathy Johnson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time to visit & food was excellent! The\nSeared Tuna app was delicious. The grilled shrimp dinner was very good. Their sautéed squash & zucchini was amazing, cooked with white wine, garlic butter. Fried okra was good, not greasy at all. Our server Laura was nice and professional. We will definitely be back, I want to try the crab cakes next time. Reasonably priced. 😋",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nikki Tatum",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We ordered the Debris Fries for the appetizer and they were honestly the best “gravy fries” I’ve ever had. I’d go there just for those! My husband got the Reuben Sandwich and said it was delicious. My mom was very impressed with the grilled shrimp. The gumbo was okay, but we’re from Louisiana so might be a little biased there.\n\nWe loved the overall vibe of this place and had a pleasant experience. We’ll be back the next time we’re in the area!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Daniella Lazo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "WOW, this place was fantastic! The fish, hushpuppies and mac and cheese were very good. It was packed but we got a seat quickly. However, the bread pudding was overly sweet.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tom Rourke",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a great place. The food was incredible. I had not ate such delicious food in a very long time. I got a big bonus there. Got to listen to BB King while there and got to spend time with Melissa. If you get the privelidge to be at one of her tables, you will make a new friend. Don't forget to get a great local beer.  We will be back soon.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
    "price_level": 2,
