  {
    "place_id": "ChIJadKR4GavkIgR_AllxSM8qu0",
    "name": "Sunset Grille",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "14050 Canal A Way, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-492-1063",
    "website": "https://myholidayharbor.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17125566657362987516",
    "lat": 30.3117405,
    "lng": -87.4394828,
    "plus_code": "8H66+M6 Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 2675,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Daniella Lazo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Delicious shrimp and hush puppies. The view was beautiful!! The gift shop had an awesome sale going on. The only complaint was that our server was hard to track down.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chris Martin",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Food was good. We ordered popcorn shrimp, Philly steak, chicken tenders, and a side salad. Portions were more than enough. Great great views and atmosphere for sunsets. Service was a little slow. I waited about 20 minutes for a drink which I'm never usually picky about. But when it's 96 and you've been eating a bunch. A cold drink is appreciated. Other than that I highly recommend.. well definitely go back this trip.",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lorraine Irby",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My favorite place specially every summer. The sunset is very stunning. The foods are great and sumptuous. While eating you can watch the dolphins, all kinds of birds by the lagoon.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "jeff robichaud",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Nice little place off the main road with a beautiful view of the inlet bay in Perdido Key. Food was excellent and they had a wonderful area for kids to plat outside.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amanda Hunter",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The water view is beautiful, the service was great. Hush puppies and smoked tuna dip to start. ( the tuna dip was divine) I got the fried grouper Ruben, my boyfriend got the \"unicorn\" po boy. I think they said it was trigger fish, we both loved it all. Its pet friendly as well",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      }
    ],
