    "place_id": "ChIJ80wPXvkGmogRoXHzmMSqFZU",
    "name": "Rotolo's Pizzeria",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25755 Perdido Beach Blvd ste f1, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-8895",
    "website": "http://www.rotolos.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10742680247518589345",
    "lat": 30.2704095,
    "lng": -87.58881629999999,
    "plus_code": "7CC6+5F Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.1,
    "reviews_count": 1983,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Michael Bruce",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "It’s a chain, but still a food place for pizza while you’re at the beach. Some good speciality selections, but can choose your own toppings if you prefer.  Crust is a little thicker than a lot of places and has good chew. Large dining room at it stays busy during beach season.  Even so the staff is efficient.  A good choice for pizza at the beach.",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shakti Tripathy",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Ordered 2 large pizzas and they were nice. First time I have experienced cheese filled Pizzas. We were there during afternoon so it was almost empty but the music was good. Seating capacity both inside and outside was enough for a large gathering. Wait time was about 15 minutes as was told before hand. I felt pizza options were not much and toppings were not enough. On a Chicken pizza, we struggled to find a piece of the same. Other toppings were also not much visible. The taste though was good ",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Judy Scurlock",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "On vacation and this place is across from hotel. Overall rating on google was a 4.1. But we feel it deserves a higher rating. We really enjoyed our pizza. We ordered pepperoni with green peppers. We love trying pizza joints and this rates a 9 out of 10. The tomato sauce was good and the crust was well cooked through out not soggy. Only wished it had more green pepper on it. The waitress was very friendly and attentive, however when we went to pay the check it took her 10 minutes to return. She w",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Katana Motors",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "That was a nice cheat day.  I am going to have to run 20 miles to get all this food out of my system.  You can never go wrong with Pizza, specially the Maui Wowi Jumbo Pizza and 16 piece chicken wings.  Nice one!",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Steven and Shelly",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First visit to Rotolo Pizzeria was fantastic!  Our server, Jamie, recommended the lasagna and she was spot on—it was incredible. We’re already planning our next trip back to try the calzones. Also, a huge Happy 30th Anniversary to the Rotolo Pizzeria! Great food and service.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      }
    ],
