    "lng": -87.5847816,
    "plus_code": "7CR8+63 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 3.6,
    "reviews_count": 114,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Chelsie Ammons",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "They are INCREDIBLY skimpy on their ingredients. If you order off the app and arent watching them make it to insure youre not getting half the ingredients you should be getting, this is what your sandwich will turn out like 😅  theres litterally  a total of 6 leaves of lettuce on an entire footlong. I asked for extra black olives and have maybe 16 pieces on the entire thing... the smaller tomatoe slices ive ever seen... just a major joke of a sandwich. Super disappointed. Asked for extra ranch bu",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tammy Brents",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Worst sandwich ever! I had the Boss. The sauce was burnt, the lettuce should have been thrown away 2 days ago. This is the second time eating here the first time was not good but not this bad. I won't be back for a 3rd time.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Michael Usher",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "If you go to the location and you can't figure out or have a problem joining the club app don't look for help and expert to pay full price .",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "EchoSei",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I guess I will have to start checking my pick up orders before leaving the store. They forgot spinach, olives, jalapeños and the sauce!! This is so dry and nasty. What a waste.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melanie Doll",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Excellent service!  I placed a large catering order of boxed lunches the night before online and they were ready and waiting at exactly the time that I requested the next morning. 100% accurate and bagged and each was labeled on what was inside. Great customer service and very friendly employees.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      }
    ],
