  {
    "place_id": "ChIJSTG2eDMOmogRMfLH6dGR8yc",
    "name": "Bella's Pizza",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "2601 S McKenzie St, Foley, AL 36535, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-230-2011",
    "website": "",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=2878804917576266289",
    "lat": 30.3753852,
    "lng": -87.6785022,
    "plus_code": "98GC+5H Foley, AL, USA",
    "rating": 2.6,
    "reviews_count": 36,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Kirstin Powley",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Biggest mistake! Really should of turned away when they were reheating the food! Don't understand how they have a 99 for an inspection! 2 small bites and I was done! 2 small bites is all it took to make me sick hours later! Waste of money! Don't go here! Save yourself the tummy ache and waste of money!",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Stephen Duke (Eaglescoutduke)",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Payed $20 for a grocery store hotdog with canned Chilli and the Stromboli. I was supposed to get chips with my Chilli dog and didn't. We also ordered a large \"fresh\" lemonade that was literally  Kool Aid Lemon. 2 people tried to refill drinks while they were ringing my food up and they freaked out asking them to run a credit card for 55c and charging a 25c card fee. Overall this place is one big scam. Nothing is what they advertise. They also sell beer and mixed drinks for some reason?",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Gayle McDow",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Worst calzone I've ever paid money for. Literally had 3 pepperoni, 6-8 pieces of diced ham and a ridiculous amount of ricotta cheese.   Bread was chewy, hard to cut.\n\nStromboli was much better. Guess I picked the wrong thing...",
        "time": "9 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matthew Gahafer",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "This place is an absolute joke.   Pizza was terrible.   8 dollars a slice would be okay if it were actually good.   They don't even use real cheese but cheese \"product\".   Avoid this place like the plague.",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Judy Aquino",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is a great place to eat! The people are friendly and the food is good, especially the pepperoni pizza it's so good, I normally don't eat pizza, but when my friend asked me to try it, which I did, and it was so good and not regretting it. I'll definitely recommend it. I assure you you'll like it.",
        "time": "8 years ago"
      }
    ],
