  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ82sXi8oXmogRjBEMetjkK70",
    "name": "Waffle House",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "12615 Foley Beach Express, Foley, AL 36535, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-943-5411",
    "website": "https://locations.wafflehouse.com/foley-al-1851",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13631240315578618252",
    "lat": 30.4079818,
    "lng": -87.6480911,
    "plus_code": "C952+5Q Foley, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.1,
    "reviews_count": 884,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Timmy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The employees are awesome always. Your not treated like a number, the cooks/ employees are very caring, polite, and actually know you by name and 9 1/2 times out 10 they know exactly what I'm going to order/ eat...\nAll the Waffle House employees are always very outgoing, professional and caring...",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Neikygames",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The best waffle house in baldwin county! Food always great. Kerri and Jessica always put a smile on my face. Jacob did amazing with my eggs and bacon! My 6 year old said 1000/10",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bruce InCharlotte",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Early on a Saturday morning, it was not yet crowded. I was able to get my favorite seat at the low counter where I could watch people coming and going. And it's always awesome to watch the kitchen try to keep up.\n\nJust a waffle with pecans this morning. Cooked properly and served quick. I timed it - less than eight minutes from the time I walked through the door to the time I had my breakfast. Zero complaints!\n\nCrew was busy and the restaurant was clean. It was perhaps a little loud with the mus",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "jonathan radosavlevici",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Very nice friendly environment. Clean tables. Jennifer was prompt very kind and took my order as soon as I was ready. Food came out very fast , the sandwich and hash browns were made perfectly as well. Definitely recommend this waffle house",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Trent Powell",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "First time eating at this Waffle House, and it wasn't good. They were not busy but there was an extremely noticeable lack of organization and communication. Seemed like the cook was probably to new to be running the flat top by himself and the server didn't see very experienced himself. The reason I gave a 2 Star review was the politeness of the server to no charge for our drinks after we left following a lengthy wait without satisfaction.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      }
    ],
