  {
    "place_id": "ChIJXaeFO5IHmogR-_lc83OhthM",
    "name": "Tiki & Raw Bar",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "27844 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-277-4800",
    "website": "https://www.tikibarorangebeach.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1420500251858237947",
    "lat": 30.2928504,
    "lng": -87.5491365,
    "plus_code": "7FV2+48 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.4,
    "reviews_count": 1221,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Courtney",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "People say the food is great, but I would call it subpar. Overcooked burnt food. To top it off, John or HOA the angry bartender was rude the entire time I was there. Which is odd because the day before, I had no issues with Nick and had great beverages, but the kitchen was already closed. The view is great, but the rudeness of John overpowered the entire experience. I'm not sure if I would recommend this place to anyone. Childish behavior from staff is unwanted when coming to unwind for day. Bri",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin Brophy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love this place!! Such a great vibe and atmosphere.  Location is absolutely perfect! Live music is good for the soul! I highly recommend this place.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Gary Leemgraven",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Great Waterfront Restaurant. Good menu variety, live music and Nice Atmosphere. Friendly service. We are sure to visit again.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "John Reese Outdoors",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "So I hate to leave really negative reviews but the staff needs to do better also. We stood at the hostess table for 10min before we were told to seat ourselves. Now the live music could have been the issue. We sat outside for the view. We have eaten here before so no biggie. We ordered everything at once cause we had a long wait before our server saw us. We had to flag down another server to replace the sour tea we were given. The food was great, just someone had a bad night. For the sever who w",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Charles Conrad",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Food and drinks were really good.  Service was good but slow...there seemed to be 1 dedicated person to the outside venue and it was full because of the live music.  The server was doing his best and our orders were always correct...it was busy and live music scheduled....made service slow.  I do recommend visiting and we will be back.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
