  {
    "place_id": "ChIJsUmN4rcEmogRAzoLxzgXS1I",
    "name": "Papa John's Pizza",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "24515 Commercial Ave, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-7200",
    "website": "https://locations.papajohns.com/united-states/al/36561/orange-beach/24515-commercial-avenue",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=5929858866988399107",
    "lat": 30.291073,
    "lng": -87.6061338,
    "plus_code": "79RV+CG Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 3.3,
    "reviews_count": 388,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jason Brown",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Read all the other reviews and then ordered anyway. I live in Orange Beach not Gulf Shores so that helps. My pizza arrived early and was delicious. I got the Shaq-a-roni for $13.99 deal!",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "joel donald",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Well I guess finding an employee with basic social skills is difficult in this business. Well at least the pizza was decent. Probably will not go back though.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Blake Kennedy",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Placed an order and waited 1.5 hour due to the DoorDash driver not knowing the address. I called the driver Matthew M. Twice and he told me he was bringing our food. Then, It was noted it was returned to the store so I called and the lady that answered gave me a story she there by herself. So I went up there to ensure she could provide me a credit for my transaction. There were 6 employees there and no one seemed to know what was going on. I wanted the pizza but credited on my delivery and tip b",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "damian keeler",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "You never get what you order. Pay extra for nacho cheese sauce and you never get it. Guess the delivery driver keeps it or the store is just incompetent. Pizza is never fully cut, had to cut our own pizza and cheese sticks. The last 2 or 3 times I’ve ordered I never and I mean NEVER get my cheese sauce. Save yourself time and spend the extra somewhere else. Because apparently they are just incompetent at reading",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Isaac Barnoskie",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Please not that this review and rating is based on consolidation of Google Maps reviews from two locations. Rather than the Gulf Shores location being permanently closed and a separate location added, it appears that the address was changed to Orange Beach so that reviews would remain on same location.\n\n2023 Orange Beach Location: Pizzas were ordered via Papa John’s mobile app. (If you eat Papa John’s fairly often like we do, this is the way to go, as you accumulate points which results in free ",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
