  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ4V7NskmokIgRZIKp1zJ-kYQ",
    "name": "Flora-Bama Ole River Grill",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "17400 Perdido Key Dr, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-483-6262",
    "website": "https://www.florabamaolerivergrill.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9552555041461207652",
    "lat": 30.2826447,
    "lng": -87.51806119999999,
    "plus_code": "7FMJ+3Q Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 5231,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jerry Dunne Sr",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Great food, I had the Philly cheese steak with onions, peppers and mushrooms and it was delicious 👍 better than anticipated.  Onion rings are also spot on!\nIndoor atmosphere is good, signed wall similar to the bar across the street but much newer.  Great outdoor dining option with great views ( we sat inside.)\nOur service was excellent 👌.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Angel Matthews",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Customer service is phenomenal here. Everyone is so kind, made sure we was good the whole time. Food was amazing. Most definitely would recommend this place to everyone. Hailey is great at doing her job she deserves a raise.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Stephanie Palmer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We enjoy a delicious dinner - the grouper & shrimp basket, fries and hush puppies. Our adorable waitress, Hailey,  recommended an app- the key lime shrimp-yummy!!! Great service, fun atmosphere & tasty food! Quick food delivery, too!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Harold Willson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Warmly greeted when we walked in. Had a group of 7. 5 kids and 2 adults. They brought colorful slushies for the kids and they were super happy to have them. The food is amazing and the service was on par and top notch. Cameron was our server and did an excellent job. We also got the Key Lime-colada and highly recommend.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "John Sims",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Our server Carlos did an excellent job! The shrimp and grits is the best thing on the menu and worth the price!\n\nBut the reason I gave this a four-star was the price and flavor ratio. The price was a little high for the quality and portion size of the food.\nI got crab claws for the market price of $30 and they were just the claw with a portion of the the meat still attached to the vein, not the thick portion of the claw itself.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      }
    ],
