    "phone": "+1 850-483-6272",
    "website": "https://www.florabamayachtclub.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16318555786423088360",
    "lat": 30.2827071,
    "lng": -87.5172722,
    "plus_code": "7FMM+33 Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 4181,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Deep South",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Google shows temporarily closed, but I was here on Jan. 2nd, 2026 and they were certainly open. Busy bar, they could use another bartender even in the not so off season. I was surprised by how good the food was! Got the oyster sampler, which wasn't listed on the main menu??? My wife had the flatbread and it was good too. Ice cold beer and well prepared food. What more could you ask for?",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "AB R",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Stopped in for lunch, shout out to the best & our favorite server there, HANNAH Mc. Fried crab claws still delicious and nutritious and the tuna dip was fantastic with the new chips. C power forever. #Cpowa #IYKYK",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kellis Williams",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Easy 20/5 stars. This place is the real deal!\nWe heard nothing but rave reviews all the way from Southern Illinois — and now we know why. Flora-Bama Yacht Club absolutely crushed it. Killer food, lightning-fast service, and one of the most laid-back, family-friendly vibes on the coast. Kids comfortable. Adults relaxed. Zero stress.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer Olson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The food was excellent, everything we ate was so good. Bradley and Patrise gave excellent service with a wonderful personality. We will definitely go back!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Randi Kittrell",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "John and Duy are the best bartenders ever! They’re very attentive and give the friendliest service. Give them all your tip money!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
