  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ6xKDDAgHmogRAE8nfvLDjqM",
    "name": "Zeke's Landing and Marina",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "26619 Perdido Beach Blvd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-4044",
    "website": "https://www.zekeslanding.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=11785572721141174016",
    "lat": 30.2753463,
    "lng": -87.5695817,
    "plus_code": "7CGJ+45 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 2857,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Russell Ingram",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Two of my boys and two of their friends all 4 went fishing with capt Will on board Kittywake. They fished inshore and had a blast. Caught limit of Sheepshead  and other fish. Captain Will took care of the boys and made sure they had a blast.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shane Parris",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a great father-son fishing trip on Killin Time! Just us two with captain Colby. He put us on some nice redfish. He was very knowledgeable of the area and very friendly and interactive. He kept our lines baited and got the fish off quickly and got us back out in the water to catch more! He also took care of cleaning the fish for us. We had a great experience and definitely will do it again!!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Austin Axley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Very awesome experience. Offshore fishing is  way different then from the fishing we do back home. The captain and deck hand were great to talk to and very knowledgeable. We did a 8 hour trip time goes pretty quick. We had a shared expense with 8 other people. Would definitely do it again. The only thing is we would do a 4 hour trip just because it wears you out being in the sun and reeling in fish but it was probably the funnest fishing I’ve done. Other then a lot of cranking you don’t have to ",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Richard Beckham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We booked 2 boats, Annie Girl and Sea Hunter, and both crews were exceptional. We limited out on vermillion snapper. The weather wasn’t perfect but both crews made it a memorable trip for our crew. We will definitely book another trip through Zeke’s.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matthew Tanaka",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Captain Alex and his crew are top notch. We had an excellent 44 hour trip. We caught a 175 lb yft and lost 3 equal size or bigger. I highly recommend taking a charter on the Sea Hunter!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
