  {
    "place_id": "ChIJxxwt8EAFmogRdMLZnSChNW8",
    "name": "Tuscany Pizza and Grill",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "Pelican Place, 3800 Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-948-0777",
    "website": "http://tuscanypizzaandgrill.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8013488273434985076",
    "lat": 30.3027229,
    "lng": -87.6802513,
    "plus_code": "8839+3V Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 971,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Bev Horn",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "LOVE this plsce. You think you’ve walked into Italy with the atmosphere and food.  We’ve had anll different meals and Tiffany is without a doubt the best server.  She is so helpful in understanding the menu and suggestions.  Friendly to all. Love their pizza. Fixed just like I like it!!!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mia Ristau",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The alcoholic drinks were made perfectly two of them had me right where I needed to be by one of the waitresses there with long black hair. She was also our waitress and was wonderful, tended to us at the perfect times. The food was delicious and for the price was def worth it seems like it wouldn't be enough food but it filled us up and tasted wonderful. Its like fancy resteraunt but at a affordable price. We went in the late evening and sat outside and it was wonderful. I would eat here again ",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Elizabeth Schisler",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The food is fantastic. You can tell when something is made from scratch with quality ingredients. Our server Lana was also very professional and friendly. We really enjoyed our meal and will definitely return!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "JG",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Sunday night dinner.  Went here for dinner.  Got seated instantly, waitress took my drink order right after.  I ordered the SPAGHETTI ALLA PESCATORA with Alfredo sauce.  Order probably took about 15 to 20 minutes. This dish was outstanding and I would highly recommend it. Great service, atmosphere and food.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amy Cunningham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Awesome service!  Everyone loved their food.  We had 19 or so people descend upon them on a Monday night and everything was perfect’",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
