  {
    "place_id": "ChIJQ905j5IRmogRG4TocLT79mI",
    "name": "Bleus Burger Restaurant and Bar",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "3800 Gulf Shores Pkwy #240, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-219-8448",
    "website": "http://www.bleusburger.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=7131163812394730523",
    "lat": 30.3010411,
    "lng": -87.68096,
    "plus_code": "8829+CJ Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.4,
    "reviews_count": 1241,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Tyler Smith",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Late lunch, went for a burger, ordered the shrimp n grits, glad I did. Wow! Plump, blackened shrimp, 6 pieces, grit cakes were delicious, piping hot, the sausage & cream sauce were wonderful. Like I said, I keep showing up for a burger but they do a lot of things really well—guess I’m coming back. Good, friendly service, had an ice cold beer and thought about my next visit. I do love R&B so I could’ve stuck around. That's a nice touch. 🎶",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "James Barnes",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Cool atmosphere.\nWe were wanting a good burger after several seafood meals and this place didnt disappoint.\n\nThe burgers were delish. Our wing app was good, we got 2 flavors, and I also got the tater tots app along with my meal. Never had tots that good!\n\nHighly recommend this place.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "alyxandra OB",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The best fried pickles we have ever had! Absolutely beautiful and equally delicious burgers- and i’m not typically a burger fan!\nWe came on a Sunday at around 11 and the restaurant was mostly empty. Food came out quickly and was super fresh, all staff were super helpful and friendly especially our waiter!\nWe will absolutely be back :)",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer Gleason",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "After having all the seafood places we could handle, our Midwest bellies were craving a good burger mixed with some BBQ. The burnt end fries were amazing, the wings, the burgers were amazing! Wish we would have found this place sooner than our last 2 days here. Our waiter Austin, was absolutely the best server we have had down here this trip!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Sonya Wellman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you've never been, you have to try this place. The burgers are amazing and the fries are seasoned and they taste so good. And on the chicken wings you have to try the sesame soy 👍🏻👍🏻 I will add a photo of the burgers on the menu, but I was told that some of the burgers are seasonal",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      }
    ],
