  {
    "place_id": "ChIJr9L6Qk0OmogRNkSip_WLvB8",
    "name": "Moe's Original BBQ",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "20733 Miflin Rd, Foley, AL 36535, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-923-0079",
    "website": "https://www.moesoriginalbbq.com/lo/foley",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=2286856597993047094",
    "lat": 30.3714608,
    "lng": -87.6687624,
    "plus_code": "98CJ+HF Foley, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.4,
    "reviews_count": 1567,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Zoe Gehman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Very cute inside. Live music on Saturday night was great! I had the side platter with fried green tomatoes, hash brown casserole and cabbage casserole. All very good but the cabbage casserole was so amazing I’ll need to figure out how to make at home!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amanda Major",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "*Moe’s Original BBQ, “A Southern Soul Food Revival,” is located near OWA on Mifflin Road in Foley, Alabama, several red lights off of HWY 59. It’s a chain restaurant, which really means absolutely nothing, because their food consistently tastes uniquely fantastic. I’ve never had a bad meal here, and the staff is always top notch. 🌟Moe’s has been serving Alabama-Style BBQ since 1988. For people like me who don’t cook, that means they slow-smoke their meat in a pit using oak and fruit hardwoods. T",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shawn Shepherd",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you're looking for some good bbq and sides, this is the right place. And while the food was really good....the staff were amazing! Super friendly and knowledgeable about the menu, made recommendations (which were spot on) and genuinely appeared to like what they were doing.\n\nWe arrived closer to closing time but we're never rushed and even got to hear some singing as the staff were doing a final cleaning for the night.\n\nWe'll definitely be back.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Julia Tassin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time eating at Moe’s and it was such a great experience! It’s dog friendly and everyone was so kind and sweet. I got the chicken nachos and it was delicious! The nice man even came outside to say hello and offer some turkey to my dog, overall just a great environment!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kat F",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Excellent barbecue place. Order your food at the front and it's delivered to your table. Food was very tasty and alot of it. Friendly staff.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
    "price_level": 2,
    "business_status": "OPERATIONAL",
    "types": [
      "bar",
      "establishment",
      "food",
      "point_of_interest",
      "restaurant"
