  {
    "place_id": "ChIJgUAv1HavkIgR1_IjP2KWD4Q",
    "name": "Purple Parrot Beach Bar & Grill",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "13555 Perdido Key Dr #1, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-466-3805",
    "website": "http://www.perdidokeyresortmanagement.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9515989886367429335",
    "lat": 30.3036806,
    "lng": -87.4259134,
    "plus_code": "8H3F+FJ Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.2,
    "reviews_count": 409,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Samantha Neal",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had such a wonderful time at this place on our first visit! The atmosphere was lively and fun, with live music that added an extra touch to the experience. The food was absolutely delicious, and every bite left us wanting more. Our favorite part, though, was the service—our bartender Kelly was amazing, making sure we felt welcome and taken care of. We will definitely be back for more great food, drinks, and good vibes! Highly recommend this spot!",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Linsey Osborn",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Fun pool for kids with the waterfall. Nice to have an indoor option, too, with weather here. The unit family stayed in was well decorated and clean! Food and drinks are a little pricey.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Hot Wired",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "08-06-2022 ⭐⭐\nThings have improved over the lady few days. I saw NEW FOOD MENUS TODAY! Clean, fresh, and easy readable.\n\nService  by  Kelsey today was good and by Emily tonight.Both we're very attentive and friendly. Both  washed hands multiple times.\n\nThe food is good. The drinks still are stillwatered down. I saw several people talking among themselves about the drinks.   The bar was out of some main items needed to mix  drinks.\n:\nExample: Bloody Mary components. Worcester sour sauce. Horserad",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin Koontz",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is a ton of fun! Drinks are well made and quickly served. The layout is nice and the food hit the spot. I like to catch live music during the season and even if it’s slow the bartenders make good conversation.",
        "time": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tate Ellison",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Pretty fun little place.  Musicians start singing around noon. Karaoke on Wednesday evenings 6-10.  Don’t try and invite yourself to the electronic poker game they have every Wednesday afternoon.  It’s organized by the permanent residents at the resort.  We are only here once or twice a year a week at a time.  But it’s cute they have their little thing.   So far, all the food has been great.  Nothing I haven’t liked.   Servers are friendly as well.",
        "time": "4 years ago"
      }
    ],
