  {
    "place_id": "ChIJGcIpAUQFmogRA6s7Y2EfNfE",
    "name": "LongHorn Steakhouse",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "3810 Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-967-3480",
    "website": "https://www.longhornsteakhouse.com/locations/al/gulf-shores/gulf-shores/5313?cmpid=br:lh_ag:ie_ch:loc_ca:LHGMB_sn:gmb_gt:gulf-shores-al-5313_pl:locurl_rd:1262",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17380832840043440899",
    "lat": 30.303199,
    "lng": -87.68241499999999,
    "plus_code": "8839+72 Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.4,
    "reviews_count": 2235,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Amy Timms",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our food was so so good. Steaks were cooked perfectly and the sides were on point.  The sweet tea was AMAZING!! Our waitress tho wasnt all that pleasant tho. Don't even remember her name but she wasnt from here i remember that. Everything else was GREAT. Oh, the host that day was absolutely wonderful!! He should've been Our waiter.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Miroslav Vrvic",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "LongHorn Steakhouse delivered a fantastic experience—perfectly cooked steaks bursting with flavor, crisp salads, and warm buttery bread. The staff were genuinely attentive, upbeat, and knowledgeable, striking that rare balance of friendly and professional. A consistently excellent dining choice.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tazmanian",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My mom and I stopped and ate lunch here for her birthday during our Mardi Gras vacation. Our server Erica was extremely sweet and attentive, and made the whole experience 10 times better. The food was amazing, with both steaks being cooked perfectly if not very close to it. We planned to return at the end of our trip to drop off a gift for our server as well as try a different item on the menu but got caught up meeting some family and didn’t have time. Overall another very good choice for when y",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lori Johnson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The onion appetizer was incredibly delicious. The shrimp, steak and Potatoes were extremely tasty. The Bisque was so creamy and lovely.  The service was excellent. The Restaurant was clean.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "David Taylor",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Melissa was amazing. Took our order and it came out to us in perfect time. Had time to eat our salad, then the dinner came out and it was perfect. She waited on us a couple months ago and actually remembered us. We'll be going back and getting her again. Thank you so much. The Taylor's.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
