  {
    "place_id": "ChIJa3lqwXuvkIgRkuXy1ss7NJk",
    "name": "Oyster Bar Restaurant and Marina",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "13700 River Rd, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-492-5600",
    "website": "http://oysterbar31.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=11039514333262570898",
    "lat": 30.3113518,
    "lng": -87.42543789999999,
    "plus_code": "8H6F+GR Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.2,
    "reviews_count": 1847,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Brian Elliott",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Had an amazing experience here. Got there early, sat outside on the deck. Food was delicious, service was excellent, timely and kind, thank you Mama T. They oysters were perfect, the blackened grouper perfectly cooked and not overly seasoned, even the sides were excellent.  I am sure this place gets packed and crazy.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lu Desteli",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Celebrated a birthday here couple weeks ago. It was my first time there. Lovely view of the water and birds and bridge. The food was excellent. We got there early so definitely saw lots of people come in after us but we had a very good time at opening on a Sunday afternoon. There is an elevator to the eating area for those who need a little extra help.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jerry Dunne Sr",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "(2 year update). Still a great place. Found out they have a 25% Discount in February. All good and beverages. If you like bread pudding you will love theirs\n\nGreat service, wonderful food and atmosphere, did I say great service?  Try the seafood bisque.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dan",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Went with the family for an early dinner and it was great.   The portions were a good size and tasty.  The wife had the red snapper and the kiddo had shrimp Alfredo.  The service was good and the location was great.   I would definitely add it to the list of places to eat when we come back.",
        "time": "4 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kurt Farnsworth",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Two nights ago, the four of us ALL had Fantastic meals. Our server, Ava, was Absolutely Wonderful. She is an Outstanding asset to this business!  She made the entire experience a pure pleasure!",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      }
    ],
