  {
    "place_id": "ChIJc4EVbW2vkIgR9riX_nFFLt8",
    "name": "The Jellyfish - Seafood Restaurant and Bar",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "13700 Perdido Key Dr, Pensacola, FL 32507, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-332-6532",
    "website": "https://thejellyfishbar.com/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=gmb&utm_campaign=websiteclick",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16081867675291597046",
    "lat": 30.2974619,
    "lng": -87.4318479,
    "plus_code": "7HW9+X7 Pensacola, FL, USA",
    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 3343,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Ashley Endsley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We were recommended to come her by a local as we need to feed a variety of pallets and needs. This had plenty of gf options, a wonderful variety on the menu satisfying both the sea food/sushi lovers and the gluten free or land animal lovers. Trish was our server and she handled our group of 12 with ease keeping our drinks filled and food coming hot. We highly recommend this place. If you’re a sushi lover the perdido and rainbow roll were amazing and the jelly fish burger was impressive. Basicall",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Blake Powell",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "This place has a great vibe. Their 25% off for military and responders on Thursdays was truly respectable. From walk in to leaving, I had great service. I ordered an appetizer, Crab wonton and a couple of sushi rolls, the Man of War and Alaskan. Tasty but a little on the smaller side compared to other sushi places I've eaten. The rest of the menu looks great, you won't be disappointed bringing your friends here! 🪼",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Celeste RC",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I came here for vacation today and I loved everything about it. The quantity and quality of the food was perfect! I also appreciated how the servers wore gloves when handing the food. The waitress we had was absolutely delightful. She was patient, gave recommendations, polite and just an absolute delight. The atmosphere was very welcoming and calm as well. I was already having a hard day today from another restaurant that I went to which didn’t provide the best service but coming to this place, ",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "J&P PBandJ",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We had a good meal and great service. The room was a little bit cold so I kept my jacket on. The side room with more dining tables seems a little stark, but it could be because it wasn't crowded that evening. In addition to the posted pictures we had Parmesan grilled oysters, which were excellent.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amie J and Co",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The food was amazing!  Don’t sleep on the Jellyfish burger…it is one of the best burgers I’ve ever had. Trisha was our server and she was wonderful!  Super sweet and attentive. She was great at describing the sauce for me.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
