  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ5QLo4vkGmogRNvjneX-zZqQ",
    "name": "Hurricane Grill & Wings-Orange Beach",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25755 Perdido Beach Blvd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-3041",
    "website": "https://locations.hurricanewings.com/ll/US/AL/Orange-Beach/25755-Perdido-Beach-Blvd",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=11846353229932132406",
    "lat": 30.27041049999999,
    "lng": -87.5887753,
    "plus_code": "7CC6+5F Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.1,
    "reviews_count": 2611,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Amy White",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Great place to eat! We had a hard time deciding on what to order. My husband got the smothered burgerito that he said was really good. I got the Mahi sandwich and it was good.  We are fans of a fountain Pepsi, so that was a plus for us as well.  Kristen was very sweet and took good care of us.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rachael Gaylord Cargill",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Husband and I were here for Christmas. Not many restaurants were open. The hotel gave us a list of options and we chose Hurricane Grill &Wings. We were seated quickly and our server Patti suggested the wings. They were so, so, good. I had one of the best margaritas in my life. And the Miami Vice drink was very tasty. We will be back. Great service!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "The Wade Life",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "So we went twice because it was so good!\nParty of 14 mixture of adults and kids.\nThey were super accommodating.\nThey went the extra mile!\nThe food was incredible!\nWe got chips and queso as appetizer both times. The second time we got tortilla chips instead of kettle.\nAll the food was better than the high priced sit down restaurants.\nThe shrimp was the best we had in orange beach and Pensacola.\nSteak tacos were amazing!\nThe fajita bowl was delicious!\nThe staff and the environment was incredible!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mark Lewis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Always a wonderful experience at Hurricanes Grill and Wings! The food was absolutely delicious. It’s always so fresh, flavorful, and cooked perfectly. As always, everything came out hot and fast. Our waitress, LeeLee, truly made the visit even better. She was friendly, attentive, and made sure we had everything we needed without asking.   Great food, great service, and a welcoming atmosphere. We’ll definitely be back and asking for LeeLee again!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Veronica M",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "By far, our favorite place we ate for 2025 Spring Break. Great food, great service, and a very cool vibe. Will eat here when we go back. Street corn was so good!! Burgers were fantastic.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      }
    ],
