  {
    "place_id": "ChIJdTSAkrkHmogROJd5xSEn-QY",
    "name": "The Keg Lounge and Grill",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "26796 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-9462",
    "website": "https://www.facebook.com/thekegloungeandgrill",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=502475859429005112",
    "lat": 30.2929161,
    "lng": -87.567889,
    "plus_code": "7CVJ+5R Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 668,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jeff",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "This was a nice hole in the wall bar.  Had lunch their and burgers were fantastic and all the food was cooked to order fresh.  People were very nice as well.  Of the beaten path but definitely recommend",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "ALD",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Walked into The Keg expecting burgers, beers, and the usual smoke cloud. Walked out full, happy, and mysteriously not stinky. Witchcraft? Science? Either way impressed!! 🍻 🍔\nThe nostalgia of this place is so cool!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tommy LaConte",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you like a good burger then by all means visit The Keg in Orange Beach.  This little bar has an award winning burger that is sure to please.  I’ve been back several times and it never disappoints. The staff is always friendly and the beer is cold!!",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "christi Horne",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I absolutely loved this bar! Great vintage place I feel I stepped back in the 80s and 90s.And Jack I think that was is name was a awesome dude me and my husband Sammy enjoyed talking to him about music 🎶.I highly recommend this place and absolutely the best Cheeseburger and onion rings I've ever had plus my husband was pleased too you could smoke in there.We will be back whenever we visit Orange Beach again.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lori Hootman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We grabbed a drink at this super fun, casual bar.  Our bartender/server, Cindy, was so attentive and warm.   She greeted us, served us and greeted all who entered.  Great local bar with pool tables and gambling machines. The bar offers a neighborhood bar experience!",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      }
    ],
