  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ790qQUwGmogRLt_3sW6zk7U",
    "name": "O'choppers",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25910 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-974-1300",
    "website": "https://www.facebook.com/OChoppers-Irish-Pub-55898211818/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13083998630455009070",
    "lat": 30.290699,
    "lng": -87.5826847,
    "plus_code": "7CR8+7W Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 343,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "L Kelley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came here for the first time after basically getting rained out at The Wharf Ampitheater. Food is great. Patty Melt and Chicken bites are a must. Have a couple of darker beer selections plus normal light beer options. Miro served us at the bar and when we moved to a table. Service was top notch. Energy and vibe is great. 🤟👍👍",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Charles Ross",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My wife and I visited O’Choppers twice and sat at the bar just for a couple of beers. It was extremely friendly, and the price for beer was extremely reasonable.  Definitely plan on frequenting them when we’re back in the area",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chelsea Ross",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I came in tonight, never been. My dad passed away this week and I just wanted to sit somewhere where no one knew me and have a drink. I was greeted by Lucas (sp?) and asked if he had a drink menu. He laughed and asked what I was in the mood for… he made me the perfect rum punch and had great\nconversation. While he had no idea what I was going through, his smile and hospitality meant more than he knew. Beautiful bar atmosphere, great drinks and clean facility. Will be back again! Thank you.",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rocky C",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "By far the absolute best wings and onion rings around! The atmosphere is always fun, service is always excellent, and the price is just right. They definitely have a repeat customer with me.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matt",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I just stopped by for a drink yesterday, but this place is always a treat!",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      }
    ],
