  {
    "place_id": "ChIJp0rKPUwGmogRMAA9nSaGQ7k",
    "name": "Cactus Cantina Canal Road",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25908 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-974-0060",
    "website": "http://www.mycactuscantina.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13349661220861182000",
    "lat": 30.2909049,
    "lng": -87.5832107,
    "plus_code": "7CR8+9P Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 1196,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Sweet_Southern_Living",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Food is always delicious! The staff is friendly, brings your chips & salsa quickly 😋 and makes sure you don't run out if anything during your meal. Best Mexican Restaurant on the island!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Joshua Slavens",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Another Mexican restaurant that gives you small portions for full price. Charging $40 for two of these is ridiculous! Dining in gives you bigger portions, but hard to support a business that rips you off with takeout.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rachel",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Food was REALLY good!!! Atmosphere isn't super traditional and this place gives fusion vibes. Food was great! Lots of flavor and variety, fast service, excellent margaritas! Such a great little laid back casual Mexican meal.  We will be back! Highly recommend the rainbow margaritas and 3 amigo dip ♥️",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin Johnson",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "So, I've heard Mexican food is non-existent in Gulf Coast Alabama.  This place consistently rated the best. Well, it isn't great. The food was ok, but not Mexican in the least. The chips were good, light and served warm. The sauce they came with was ok. The service was excellent and the atmosphere was good. I'm from Arizona,  so my standards are high. Will I go back, yes. It's all we have out here unless I cook my own.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Larry Crain",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My go to restaurant whenever I'm in Orange Beach Alabama. Great food , amazing atmosphere, awesome wait staff & management, plus good prices! Chicken and steak quesadilla was huge, served fast & hot. If you haven't been to this restaurant on Canal Road you need to put it on your list to try.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      }
    ],
    "price_level": 2,
