  {
    "place_id": "ChIJDV39l9sHmogR1dEooOId4VQ",
    "name": "Avenue Pub - Orange Beach",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4575 S Wilson Blvd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-200-0250",
    "website": "http://www.avepub.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6116202628132688341",
    "lat": 30.2912203,
    "lng": -87.55899269999999,
    "plus_code": "7CRR+FC Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 392,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Zoe Gehman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is such a cool spot. You can beach up with your boat, hang out outside, get some drinks and some amazing food. The tuna dip with homemade pita chips was so good, would definitely get it again. All the food we had was very good.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Gary Leemgraven",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Fun Waterfront Restaurant. The Tuna Dip was delicious! And the Chicken Club was as well! Friendly Service making you feel welcome.\nWell worth the visit",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Simmons",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Just recently went here on a girls trip, our waitress Julia was a delight. The view and vibe are great. It’s very laid back. The smoked tuna dip with pita chips was delicious. The pub fries were lacking ( they were cold and the cheese wasn’t melted) my group had shrimp tacos ( really good) Parmesan Chicken ( good) blackened shrimp ( not good) fish n chips ( fish great, fries cold)  Live music (underwhelming)",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "William Wright",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Stopped in today for a quick Bushwhacker! Really cool place on the Marina. Killer happy hour with beach vibes. Great place to take the kiddos and relax and enjoy some cocktails. The views here are amazing as well as the service.",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tony Strowger",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Great place to pop over for a beer and some lovely pub food xx fish and chips really good and chicken wings tasty x shrimp was done before you could say boo. Very nice and thank you x",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      }
    ],
