  {
    "place_id": "ChIJz4UsaEIGmogR50ckasCNrjE",
    "name": "The Undertow",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25025 Canal Rd, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-3331",
    "website": "https://theundertow.shop/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3579954611360122855",
    "lat": 30.2908323,
    "lng": -87.5976219,
    "plus_code": "7CR2+8X Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 806,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "William Wright",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came here for the All You CAN EAT crawfish and royal red shrimp. It’s only $19.99 and last from 2-7pm Saturdays and Sundays only! Also… comes with conecuh sausage, corn and potatoes. Best deal I’ve came across on the island!",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Josh Walters",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "If you can’t stand smoke, then this is not the place for you. I’m mildly bothered by it but was willing to give this place a shot. The much bigger issue was the lack of any sort of customer service upon walking in. The only two employees that I saw were a bartender (who was busy) and a dj who was doing his thing. I stood waiting not knowing if I was suppose to seat myself or what. Admittedly, I wasn’t there for the drinks, but I was tempted by the AYCE shrimp.\n\nAfter a few awkward minutes, I sat",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Stacy McNair",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you're looking for a great burger and in-house breaded chicken tenders, this is your place. Our food  was delicious and service was excellent! It was great to see DJ after many years! We will definitely be back.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ernie Root",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Went for the all you can eat royal red shrimp and sausage, new potatoes and corn. They were constantly filling the items so they were hot, will definitely be going back it's on Saturday and Sunday.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chooch",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We just loved this experience! Went for the all you can eat Royal Reds! We had never had them and wanted to give them a try! So glad we did. The place was packed when we got there! We were lucky enough to get a table in the back yard! (It's the way to go!) The shrimp, red skins, sausage and corn on the cob was just delicious! It was like we were at a friend's house just hanging out in the back yard! Check these guys out! Get there early!",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      }
    ],
