    "rating": 4.9,
    "reviews_count": 12,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Beka Baer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Their food and drinks are amazing. We’ve been here 6 days now, and have tried this place multiple times (breakfast lunch and dinner) and each and every time it is GOOD. Food is full of flavor, menu is diverse with decent options for everyone (even the chicken finger kids) and the employees have been kind and helpful, each time. We don’t drink alcohol, and they gave us plenty of different choices for mocktails too! I feel Like they would do really well if they opened the restaurant to DoorDash, o",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bobby Montgomery",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Better food than I expected from a pool side venue. I liked my turkey club.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Heather Hall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place has the BEST food. We’ve tried several items and they have all been great. My favorite is the cheese nachos. The employees are all very friendly and after even just one time of me ordering, they had my order memorized. Honestly one of my favorite parts of Turquoise Place.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Susie Paschall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great food!!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Heath Hulsey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Good drinks and food, good service",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      }
    ],
