  {
    "place_id": "ChIJRwMb9JsFmogR_sX34OUO6D0",
    "name": "Gulf Babe Wine Boutique",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4593 Main St Suite C-101, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-495-0573",
    "website": "http://gulfbabe.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=4460831811395110398",
    "lat": 30.2905268,
    "lng": -87.62750369999999,
    "plus_code": "79RC+6X Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 5,
    "reviews_count": 367,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Stacy Burgos-Rodgers, Realtor",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "When it first opened a friend and I checked this place out.  Cute decor, great service and we enjoyed a couple of espresso martinis! Life gets busy and we did not visit again until last week.  We came to a wine tasting and had the best time!  Enjoyed the Feta Dip and Charcuterie Board along with 4 wines!!  The service was FANTASTIC!  They made us feel like we were the only ones there!!!  I think we will make this more of a regular thing.  Orange Beach is lucky to have such a unique and fun conce",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amanda Arat",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Gulf Babe is that girl. From the moment you walk in, the vibes are immaculate—cute, fun, and effortlessly coastal-chic. The atmosphere is perfect for a girls’ night, brunch, or just feeling a little extra while you eat amazing food.\n\nBut what truly made our experience unforgettable was our server, Cindy. She was an absolute gem—so sweet, attentive, and genuinely made us feel taken care of without being overbearing. Cindy knew the menu inside and out, gave great recommendations, and kept everythi",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dana",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came here for an oyster ornament painting class and had the best time. The peppermint espresso martinis were divine, and the homemade hummus was tasty. The carrots looked like they’d been in the fridge too long, but other than that the snacks are perfect for the occasion. Will definitely be on the lookout for more craft classes here. Thank you for a festive evening! 🎄🎨🦪❤️",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Emma Newby",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My first time coming to gulf babes was for their season 4 Bridgerton watch party. Cindy greeted me with the most welcoming energy and even directed me to another women who came by herself for me to sit with. I quickly scoped the scene and sat with that women. We had a lovely time and Cindy was doing the most amazing job making sure our drinks were full and we got out munchies. She even offered to take my picture for me! She was just such a light and immediately calmed my anxiety when arriving to",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Teresa Miller",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Wendy was an absolute gem!! She paired the wines which were absolutely delicious. The peach bruschetta was amazing!! Great time great experience! 5 stars all the way!",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      }
    ],
