    "reviews_count": 1,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jamie Box",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We went to see Kip Moore here. Awesome. We loved the layout. Only thing I'd say is they need one more set of bathrooms.  They also ran out of certain kinds of beer they said they were busy during the day. It is the wharf so I believe it. But they had other beer, so it wasn't a problem for me lol. The bar is shaped like a huge guitar. Atmosphere was cool I'd go back here no problem.",
        "time": "4 years ago"
      }
    ],
