  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ0QLUN9sFmogRU8uGGe3LeAM",
    "name": "Tee Off at The Wharf",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4619 Main St A101, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-228-4899",
    "website": "https://www.teeoffatthewharf.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=250173998515014483",
    "lat": 30.2918646,
    "lng": -87.62802839999999,
    "plus_code": "79RC+PQ Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.8,
    "reviews_count": 142,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Brandon Styles Live",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We ordered fish tacos and nachos. Food wasn't bad but the service wasn't there..like at all. I could have dined and ditched and nobody would have known.. like nobody paid attention to anything. I had to find my own utensils and ketchup. I might go back because the atmosphere was nice but I hope them the best success. I won't let this first time experience stop me from visiting again and supporting local businesses!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Leigh Marsh",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We got the Nashville Hot Chicken fingers they were good but HOT. The service was great. Danielle made sure we could watch the Auburn game. I didn’t like the taste of the tap water so I got a different drink. The potatoes were so good !!\nAsk for Danielle!!!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brennan Howard",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great spot to watch football, grab some food, and have a few drinks. It is very pretty on the inside which is also a plus. We enjoyed the wings with the dry rub seasoning and the beer cheese & pretzel for an appetizer. Both were fantastic (with great ranch). The Tee Off burger was fantastic!! Very unique and one of the best burgers in the area in my opinion. Drinks can get expensive but we had a fantastic experience.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Meredith Wadkins",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We love TEE OFF! The food is fantastic. We eat here on a weekly basis since it opened! Danielle was our server, she was excellent! Tried the new menu item - steak bowl - absolutely incredible 10/10.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dustin Reeves",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Had a great experience at The Tee off at the Wharf Restaurant. The place was extremely clean, well kept, and had a great atmosphere. The service was excellent — attentive, friendly, and on top of everything without being overbearing. You can tell they take pride in both the food and the customer experience. Definitely a spot I’ll be coming back to and recommending to friends.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
