  {
    "place_id": "ChIJWfsVlSsFmogRfzdvMSsmQxI",
    "name": "Pour Smart Bar",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4851 Wharf Pkwy E Space D-124, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-284-6747",
    "website": "http://poursmartbar.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1315937483077138303",
    "lat": 30.2951015,
    "lng": -87.62867759999999,
    "plus_code": "79WC+2G Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.9,
    "reviews_count": 144,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "M. J.",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love this place. James is off the chain. Great dude, made us feel welcome,  kept a smile on our faces the entire time. Nice selection of beers, ciders and seltzer, pour as little or as much as you want. Good selection of cocktails... Just b le aware,  the popcorn might set off the fire alarm lol. Ask James,  iykyk",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "June “Jun” Smith",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "HIGHLY RECOMMEND this location for brews. I will be honest, I’m not a beer drinker but my husband is, and this place we looked at having a sit and sip until our child woke up from her long night of partyin’ lol but they weren’t open yet. So we waited next door till they did. He ordered a Basement IPA and I was given a complimentary starburst shot  provided by James, and boiiii, let me tell you…it’s worth the stop. So if you’re near by visiting or live here, come check this location and out!",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nicole Lea",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Really a lot of fun! The bar tenders have such great personalities. Susie, Austin and Jackson! They have my favorite games there shuffleboard and cornhole! We stayed and played most of the night! Will go back.",
        "time": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tara Love",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Awesome place to try all the beer if you wanted to! It’s located in The Wharf where all the stores and movie theaters are! Giant Ferris wheel by here also! You pay by the ounce!  You put money on a pour smart card put it in the a lot where your beer is and pour! It charges as you pour!",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kyle Myers",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I want to compliment James on being one of the best managers I have ever been served by. We came in town last week and he was an absolute pleasure to talk to. Showed us how the bar worked, let us sample a drink, and gave the best customer service I've seen in a long time. Being from St. Louis, it's hard to find genuine good customer service from people who care. Thank you for reminding us that good service is still alive in places. We had a great time here! and so will you.",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      }
    ],
