  {
    "place_id": "ChIJIdxep_gFmogRosoEMDwBm4I",
    "name": "Sandshaker at the wharf",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4851 Wharf Pkwy E d130, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-923-0080",
    "website": "http://www.sandshaker.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9411117204336069282",
    "lat": 30.2947865,
    "lng": -87.6292596,
    "plus_code": "79VC+W7 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.2,
    "reviews_count": 130,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Tasty Soul",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Went there the night of the Christmas tree lighting and it's a cool place but the bartender with brunette hair and glasses sucks. She was super rude for no reason and spent majority of the night flirting with some guys at the pool table. She also over charged us on purpose. We won't be going back after this experience.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Trina Coburn",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love the Sandshaker at Pensacola Beach have been a patron there since the 80's so of course when I saw the sign at the wharf shops we had to stop. I was amazed at this bar. upon entering it is small like the one on Pensacola Beach, however walk up the ramp and bam... Huge indoor dance floor, pool table, big bar. Then walk outside and the view is gorgeous. The drinks are ice cold and our bartenders gave us amazing service. I highly recommend this place and the outside bar with Justin, Candice and",
        "time": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "EazyStreet Solutions",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I'm a local and actualized this place untill the tips I left on my receipt had been altered by the staff. When calling no one answer so I'm unable to see when a manger will be there to talk with and get this issue straightened out. I've called several times during business hours and never revived an answer.",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Toni White",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Pre concert stop last night to get food and a couple of drinks.  Spent over $60 for 2 \"snacks\" and 2 drinks.  Cool, no problem.  The bartender with long blond hair does not have the personality to be a bartender.  It took us an hour to get our food, pork sandwich and wings, yes they were busy, but when we went to get our food, the bartender blatantly ignored both myself and my husband on 2 separate occasions .  She disappeared without a word, another bartender came over to pour some drafts, was ",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chris Kuhlman",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Fun atmosphere and strong drinks. Decent vibe. 3 because I was here for karaoke and the host was more focused on playing music and getting drunk than getting people up to sing. Get a better host for the crowd and let people sing. Need to tell whomever is hosting they’re there to entertain, not to get drunk. Lots of potential but a “meh” overall.",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      }
    ],
