    "lng": -87.6295119,
    "plus_code": "79VC+R5 Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 90,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Amber Waters",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What an amazing experience!\nFirst time in this beautiful place!\nIt is a bar/lounge/new world!\nOn the outside, it looks like a jewelry store. Which come to find out the jewelry that is in the windows is real, and owned by the person that owns the establishment.\nYou need a code to get in! Found on Facebook! Changes daily!\nWonderful service! Wonderful drink! Checutery board is available. We saw it. It is beautifully put together! Best thing if your looking for a elegant place to have drinks! Outsid",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ricki Stewart",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Absolutely loved this hidden gem at The Wharf in Orange Beach. Five stars all the way.\n\nIf you’re looking for a secret spot with incredible vibes, this is it. The atmosphere is cozy yet elevated, perfect for a night out or a relaxed evening with friends. The bar area is beautiful and the seating areas are super inviting. We went with friends and had a great time!\n\nThe owners are so sweet and welcoming. You can feel the local love the moment you walk in. And the espresso martini? Amazing. One of ",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Edie Mickelson",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "We were there On Wednesday with a group of 10. We ordered Charcuterie board, red Italy bottle wine two bottles. We got one at half price. The 2nd bottle we were charged full price, should have been half price.\nI asked for a credit, but have not heard back from anyone.\nThe Charcuterie boards, had\nwere good, but space. Service was ok.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "julie c",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "This place has great ambiance and in a great location but it’s a one and done for us. The cocktail prices are what you would pay in NYC, only one person of the four of us enjoyed the flavor profile of their cocktail. It would have helped if the server could have described the drinks because the menu gives no information of ingredients. She explained that she’d only been there about a month so kept running to ask the bartenders what the drink was. When we finally figured out what we wanted, it to",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Byron Barksdale",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "It's definitely a hidden gem, but that's part of what makes this place so special. It's a must visit for those who like a more relaxed and personal bar experience. There isn't a bad drink on the menu. Between my lady and I we had 7 different selections from the menu and 1 that I let Brittany (bartender) freestyle giving her only the base spirit and not a bad bad drink in sight. The music and overall vibe is amazing. You won't be disappointed I promise.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
