    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jesse Carbullido",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I give it another 10 stars! I've lived here locally for 30+years and this is the best view and vibe to have coffee or eat lunch at hands down. I'm a huge foodie and it passed the test for me!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matthew Bly",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Cody, Lena, and Victoria were great! The service was impeccable and the atmosphere was amazing. Highly recommend stopping by for a drink if you’re here",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "GARRET TAYLOR",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Terrible over priced food and drinks please do not go to this place treacherous. Neena is terrible ! And you could possibly get food poisoning,  i wouldnt even book a condo here due to the service.",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
