  {
    "place_id": "ChIJT45V4iEPmogRA3BX8QF_kuA",
    "name": "Glenlakes Golf Club",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "9530 Clubhouse Dr, Foley, AL 36535, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-955-1220",
    "website": "http://www.glenlakesgolf.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16182136057416347651",
    "lat": 30.3632836,
    "lng": -87.63704369999999,
    "plus_code": "9977+85 Foley, AL, USA",
    "rating": 3.9,
    "reviews_count": 448,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Allison Krieger",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great Place!\nBeautiful golf course!\nFriendly & helpful staff!\nThe Pub Bar & Restaurant is amazing!\nI highly recommend!!",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "sheldon berkowitz",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Granted - the course was almost completely dormant as I played in Mid -February, but still, I played another local course last week and the fairways were mostly green. Layout is ok - nothing special.pace of play was very slow on the front nine (2.5 hrs), but picked up on the back 9 which made it more enjoyable and we finished in 4.5 hrs. Driving range was not in great shape. Made my reservation online which saved some money. Would be interested to see what it was like in prime season. Pretty bas",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "David Whiteman",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Escaped the Minnesota cold for a weekend of golf in Alabama and decided to give this place a try. We played the Dunes-Vista 18 and found some really fun, well-designed holes.\n\nThe two nines have distinct personalities: the Dunes side features great undulating fairways that keep you on your toes, while the Vista nine offers much larger fairways and a more traditional resort-style layout. Even though it's February and the fairways and rough are still dormant, the greens were rolling surprisingly w",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "DOUG BRINTON",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Went with my son and son in-law. We had a great time. Wasn't too busy so we could take our time. Since walking in the front door, we were treated like PGA pros. Cheaper course but in great shape. A couple of the fairways were messed up in spots but they have had a decent amount of rain lately. We will come back next time we visit Gulf Shores area.",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Aidan Parker",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time here, gotta say I had a blast. Course layout is very fun and challenging. Tee boxes, fairways, and greens were in perfect condition for the price paid. I will be back!!!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
