  {
    "place_id": "ChIJdwAjTIcFmogRiulKmoSaKMY",
    "name": "Alabama Sweet Tea Company",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "4601 Main St Suite B-108, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-255-6770",
    "website": "https://alabamasweettea.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=14278832512893118858",
    "lat": 30.2913598,
    "lng": -87.6280443,
    "plus_code": "79RC+GQ Orange Beach, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 14,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Bambi Starr",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This tea is amazing, the service was top tier. I highly recommended the Strawberry Sweet Tea and the Sweet Tea. Oh and did I mention they have gas mason jars that say Alabama Sweet Tea Company and u can get $2.00 refills. Oh the hours say closed but they just opened today. All the way from Illinois to Alabama for this HOMEMADE delish sweet tea.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shannon (NOLA Gent)",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Alabama Sweet Tea specializes in iced tea, biscuits and their merchandise.  You purchase your single serving of tea in a reusable large Mason jar that includes a lid and straw which is also refillable at a discounted price. They also call their unsweet tea \"The Yankee\" and I'm most certainly no Yankee and neither was my granny who also drank unsweet tea. This business also has quite a selection of self-branded merchandise and quite a few folks I saw came in just to purchase the merch. They also ",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "team kenny 99",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Had a great experience at Alabama Tea! Matthew provided excellent customer service — very knowledgeable and friendly. He even let my girlfriend and I sample the teas before purchasing. You get a glass and can switch flavors with refills for only $3, and the cup is a huge 32oz. Definitely a hidden gem if you love tea. Matthew’s service truly makes you want to keep coming back!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Vas S",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Outstanding.  I got to visit the brand new location near the Wharf in Orange Beach Alabama.  I tried the regular sweet tea and the RedHead   (strawberry infused/flavored tea).  I preferred the RedHead over the regular sweet tea and got a jar of it and a warm biscuit (the size of a large sandwich) with strawberry jelly - delicious, best biscuit ever.  The only thing that I did not like is that I feel the Mason jars are not very practical to be carrying around a shopping center.  These are heavy w",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dian Brown",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Delicious tea in a reusable glass !   Biscuits are amazing.   Going back for lots more.   I hope they freeze well",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      }
    ],
