  {
    "place_id": "ChIJ4QCXtM0FmogRRJSBzv8wh64",
    "name": "Chicken Salad Chick",
    "type": "restaurant",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "160 Cotton Creek Dr Unit 290, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-240-0058",
    "website": "https://chickensaladchick.com/gulf-shores-al",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=12576074359694791748",
    "lat": 30.29778009999999,
    "lng": -87.6811129,
    "plus_code": "78X9+4H Gulf Shores, AL, USA",
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 366,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "owen Utsey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Chicken Salad Chick in Gulf Shores is a casual, welcoming eatery that specializes in a wide variety of chicken salad flavors, offering something for everyone’s taste. The restaurant’s menu features classic, savory, and unique blends, along with fresh sides like fruit, pasta salad, and pickles. The portion sizes are generous, and the meals are served fresh, making it a satisfying option for lunch or a light dinner.\n\nThe atmosphere is bright and friendly, with a cozy, small-town charm that reflect",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christy Oyer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great place! Chicken Salad was amazing. So many different styles to choose from.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "jess w",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Chicken Salad Chick offers a fantastic, refreshing alternative to the typical fast-food run. It’s a great spot when you're craving something lighter but still satisfying. I'm a huge fan of the Fancy Nancy, which is beautifully mixed with pecans, grapes, and apple—it's sweet and savory perfection! Pair that with a side of their incredibly fresh Broccoli Salad, and you have a winner. Don't overlook their seasonal soups, either; they are always rich and comforting. Highly recommended for a quick, q",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rob Huey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Let me say I’m not a huge chicken salad person but this was definitely a great impression on me. The person at the counter was super helpful and friendly and gave me great recommendations on what to order. I not a fan of celery and unfortunately their base chicken salad that is the main ingredient has celery in it. I had the buffalo sandwich and couldn’t taste any celery and quite enjoyed the meal. I can see why people are such big fans of the franchise and the food!",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chris Yust LaClaire",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time here. Mgr gave us a sample and answered all questions. We got 4 different chicken salads. All were delicious!! Red velvet cake was the bomb! Loved our sides of grape salad and broccoli salad too! Got our foot to go and all packaged perfectly! We will return!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
