    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Carmen Teodora Ticu",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Drinks were good but food was pretty lame. Burger was tasty but it came with literally 10 fries. My egg-roll/s was MEGA SPICY, not even my husband could finish it. Light brown hair bartender was very nice and quick.\nGood atmosphere, but a bit too loud (almost club level). Definitely not a place to s",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Natashia Lee",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is our go to bar! From the incredible bartenders who always take care of us to the fun vibes. We love it here. The food never disappoints either. There is live music daily, which is awesome. If you're there when the sun is setting, you get a gorgeous view. They have an outside bar that has all ",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "William Wright",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came in today for Happy Hour. Which is AMAZING BTW! Was immediately greeted by the bartender Frank and he recommended the Happy Hour Food Specials! They come with a Busch Light! Tom’s of options to choose from. Really want to try the Mexican. They have live music and are located mins from the beach ",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ivan Hernandez",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Absolutely! Here’s a concise, engaging Google review based on your feedback:\n\n---\n\nWe’ve visited Ice House Taproom three times and always had a great experience. The view of the sunset over the bay is beautiful, and we even spotted an alligator one evening! The food is consistently good—especially t",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Edward Yates",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Went last night during happy hour, and had what started out as a good time. The food was pretty good, starting with the Santa Fe rolls, then a burger and street tacos. All the food was actually quite good, and both the burger and street tacos were on the happy hour menu. (Relevant later.)\nThe beers ",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
