    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 1371,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Ethan Rycenga",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a great hole-in-the-wall. This place rocked!\n\nIt was such a welcoming environment, having your typical dive-bar look, but also super warm and friendly.\n\nThe food was so flavorful and original. We had the wings, and they were charred to perfection with the perfect amount of siracha honey sauce. ",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ben Nighswonger",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Live bar music on stage in evening; beer was good, ale was greater, appetizers & big salad was fast & fresh … and damn fine!    Price$ were very reasonable & the staff/friendliness was top tier; this is no “ dive”, it’s just a great bar with good food & great people.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "GcommwithInspec",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The bartender and server did a great job dealing with a full place. They each came over to see what we needed. Was my first time here. Cool spot with good food options and plenty of drink options.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Harold Campbell",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Fantastic place!! Atmosphere and service was excellent!! We have had the stuffed avocado before and it was more then excellent. This time......the kitchen left the avocado in the skin/shell. We had to dig out the avocado to even eat it. Very Inconvenient process to eat that dinner. Also....the avoca",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Love Life",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Nice little establishment.\nThey had a band playing this night.\nService was great\nThe server was friendly and attentive.\nFood was okay\nMixed drinks were okay. The blueberry beer on tap was on point.\nFood was okay\nThe place was a little dark but it is a bar that serves food.\nPlenty of seating\nOverall ",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      }
    ],
