    "reviews_count": 125,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "C M",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Ate here for lunch on a friday. Our waitress was friendly and did a decent job. The food was OK. We loved the French fries. Expensive for what you get imo.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Steve M",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "Closed at 3:55 pm. Sunny 66 degrees at least 15 people with drinks in the bar area.\nDisappointed. Flew down to spend a beautiful week at tylhe Lodge. Their only outside venue closed before 5 o'clock!",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melissa NeSmith",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This ocean side bar is everything you want in a coastal hangout—laid-back, welcoming, and absolutely delicious. The burgers are a standout: juicy, flavorful, and cooked to perfection, with toppings that take them to the next level. Pair that with the salty breeze, stunning ocean views, and a lively ",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelsey Shures",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We loved our visit to the dragonfly, the mocktail flavors watermelon and Pina colada were SO good! As well as the wings, cheese curds, and crab ragoon! The kids loved the pool and fire to warm up by after.  We will definitely be back!",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lee Roberts",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Visited the pool as a guest of Gulf State Park cabins. Very nice atmosphere here by the Dragonfly. Great views! Food was good, but pricey - to be expected at beach venues.",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
