    "rating": 3.5,
    "reviews_count": 24,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Tiffani Anderson",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "What a let down. Drinks were mediocre, felt like more soda water than anything. Food was pretty bad. The bulgogi fries were smothered in way too much sauce and the meat was almost too salty to eat.\nThe ahi tuna nachos were lackluster. I’ll take the ahi nachos from Coastal down the road any day.\nWe a",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amber Walker",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Such a fun atmosphere! The food was great even though the chicken sandwich and burgers don't come fully dressed. There were oversized board games which were fun. Our host (forgot his name but he has lots of tats) was amazing.\nAlso be prepared to be able to pay more than one way because some cards ar",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Sepko",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a GREAT SPOT to enjoy live music, sports on the big screen, Cocktails, and a fantastic view of the State beach! Officially Opening July 25th, 2025.  Public welcome!",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dave Fiscus",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Fun atmosphere with the big screen TV.  However, the bartenders act as though they hate their job, are rude and provide poor service.  Definitely will not go back.  Too many local places that appreciate your business.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "angeldolls lps",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "The tuna nachos and the wings on the menu say GLUTEN FREE, but they made a gluten intolerant family member very sick. Extremely disappointing. DO NOT come here if you are sensitive or intolerant to gluten and looking for options, because the menu just straight up LIES.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
