  {
    "place_id": "ChIJj4v-BWAamogR-qAyj4i6h2s",
    "name": "Billy's Seafood",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Gulf Shores",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "16780 River Rd, Bon Secour, AL 36511, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-949-6288",
    "website": "https://billys-seafood.net/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.3011523,-87.7373839",
    "lat": 30.3011523,
    "lng": -87.7373839,
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 424,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Katie Nuest",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you want fresh seafood at a great price, this is the place to be!  The owners and workers are wonderful as well!!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin Cheadle",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Excellent choices of sea food, and other items.  The hot fresh crawdads were some of the best I've ever had, when you go to Billy's don't forget to get some hot fresh crawdads.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Randall Sujat",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I asked for large shrimp from front showcase. They pulled the shrimp from a large trash barrel. The shrimp were small to medium. Much smaller than the ones displayed. Very disappointed ☹️. Photo doesn't depict the whole pound.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "G Man",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "The pictures will explain pretty much everything. These were supposed to be 16 to 20 ct shrimp.  It was also supposed to have been a pound. Check out the wild varying size of the shrimp and also the quantity. I included the spoon for scale. That's not a regular size plate. That's a small dessert pla",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Andy Frazier",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have been coming to Billy’s to get fresh grouper, shrimp, oysters, flounder, and other things that swim for quite awhile now and let me tell you, it doesn’t get any better if you want fresh off the boat seafood. If it swims, they have it and it’s fresh! Billy’s knows how to treat their customers. ",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      }
    ],
