  {
    "place_id": "ChIJO7Ij3tkEmogRhFweTz9pdhs",
    "name": "Blalock Seafood & Specialty Gulf Shores",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Gulf Shores",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "1911 Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-968-5811",
    "website": "http://blalockseafoodgulfshores.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.2717365,-87.6880923",
    "lat": 30.2717365,
    "lng": -87.6880923,
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 742,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Wendy Pounds",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The spicy “Low Country Boil” from Blalock Seafood Market was a total winner! Loaded with fresh shrimp, corn, potatoes, and Conecuh sausage — all steamed to perfection and packed with bold flavor. Messy, delicious, and totally worth it. YUM!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer Gleason",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The ladies were extremely helpful! The shrimp boil is amazing, great price, and more than enough food. We ordered 6 orders (family of 6) $10 an order. And we were able to eat it for 2 meals and still had plenty left over.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tony Mason",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Inexpensive and high quality low country boil. We picked it up on the way home from Saturday night mass.  We will do this again.   Staff was friendly and helpful, food was great.  Shrimp were perfect!  Too many places over cook their shrimp, these were excellent!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Blair Bauer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I love coming back home to visit family and my grandfather requested that we pick up some steamed shrimp from Blalock’s for dinner. It was actually the first time I had been in there after unknowingly passing it for years. The staff was very friendly and helpful. We got 1.3lbs of medium-sized shrimp",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Sariah Brooks",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The shrimp and snow crab legs were cooked to perfection.  The owner, Alex, was extremely helpful and so nice.  And the cashier was friendly and helpful.  There were so many good seafood choices I wish we’d discovered it sooner on our trip; we would’ve bought food there every day.  And it smelled del",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
    ],
