  {
    "place_id": "ChIJpxg3KsMFmogRCJRnNqS2leQ",
    "name": "Brookman's Smokehouse",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Gulf Shores",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "1544C Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-215-5332",
    "website": "http://www.brookmanssmokehouse.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.2665292,-87.6879931",
    "lat": 30.2665292,
    "lng": -87.6879931,
    "rating": 4.9,
    "reviews_count": 92,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Tamara Johnson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you are in Gulf Shores or Orange Beach,  run here for an excellent meal option.\nHated waited until leaving to stop by.  Got the smoked pork chops.  One pork chop will feed two adults.   The flavor is on point and tender.  My car is still smelling like a smokehouse.   The prices very fair.  My GPS",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tony Weaver",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Honestly some of the best smoked pork chops I've ever eaten. Lots of meats/fish to choose from. Sausage is excellent too. Definitely worth stopping in if in Gulf Shores. Just check hours first.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin Holtzhouser",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Smoked sausage, smoked pimento cheese, and smoked jalapeno were fantastic.  Glad we stumbled across this place.  So good that we’ll be going back before we leave town in a few days.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Andrew Lancaster",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "One of the best smoked places I ever visited. Got the smoked yellowfin tuna, smoked pork chop which is ridiculously thick, along with smoked sausage, smoked tuna dip, all had tremendous flavor, and the best part, unbelievable great prices for what you can get, feed the whole family no problem. The g",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Michele Holtzhouser",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This was maybe the best smoked meat I’ve ever had. Great prices too! The owner was very helpful in answering my gluten questions.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
