        "author": "jennifer smay",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Birthday weekend complete. Great food... but what's really to brag about was the service! Wesley took amazing care at lunch and then at dinner ( yes we came back) he introduced us to Sarah that truly delivered!! Would recommend 100% 👌   If I had to say something negative ( not complaining) a real gl",
