        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My husband and I are so glad we found this amazing restaurant. Of course we started with oysters for our appetizer. They were fine, but could be better. The star of the evening was the, catch of the day,  Bronzed, Grouper fish. It was fantastic, absolutely cooked to perfection! The best cooked fish ",
        "time": "2 years ago"
