    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Taylor Grayson 33",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Country Boil for 2 is $25! Lots of shrimp, 2 large corn on cob, 2 large sausages, 6-8 or so potatoes! Snow crab cluster is $26 a lb. All of this for $50! Awesome place. Mild, medium and Cajun garlic butter seasoning available!\n\nWent back later in the week. Got the same thing! Def recommend! Best ban",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Russ Coker",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "As someone who has been coming to Gulf Shores all my life and grew up eating gumbo in New Orleans. However this was some of the best Gumbo I’ve had since I left the 504. The boudin was outrageous, the andouille was great, the old bay butter was perfect (you can never go wrong with a good whipper but",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "sheri horcick",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We ordered this amazing seafood from Goldbelly and had it shipped overnight to northern Alabama ! What a fantastic experience, everything was still cold and ice packs were still solid even in this 90 degree Alabama heat ! The shrimp are very large , sausage corn and potatoes fresh and the instructio",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "James & Angel Patterson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Don’t sleep on this place! It was our third market stop today. We grabbed the lump crab dip and everything seasoned bagettes. That didn’t even make back to the fam. We were looking for boudin. They had a small variety and the balls are always my personal fave. Can’t wait to cook them! Customer servi",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Beth Knockwafel",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We arrived to find that they were very busy and understaffed; however, the workers were amazing! They were so exceptional that even my teenage sons suggested I write a review. The staff was incredibly friendly and helpful. The shrimp was fantastic, and the peanut butter pie was delicious! I can't wa",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      }
