        "author": "Lisa Mayberry",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Gluten friendly menu with chicken wings and fries because they bake them and didn't fry them. Even got gluten free Reese's pie to go. And they have a dog friendly patio with a menu to order for your pet.",
