        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Honestly, I guess we will never know how this place is. We arrived at 9:15 PM sign on the door said they were open till 10 PM and the neon “open” sign was on. When we walked in there was one person behind the bar and two other employees sitting at the bar on their cell phones. Restaurant was empty, ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tricia Thurman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We absolutely loved this place!! So much so we went back a 2nd time. Great food & drinks!! We also enjoyed their Happy Hour deals on drinks!! It was within walking distance from our hotel which made it very convenient also!! We will definitely go back here if we vacation in Gulf Shores again!",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "owen Utsey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Island Wing Company in Gulf Shores is a casual, energetic spot that’s perfect for wing lovers and anyone looking for a fun, laid-back dining experience. The restaurant specializes in chicken wings with a wide variety of sauces and seasonings, ranging from classic buffalo and barbecue to unique, bold",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
