        "rating": 2,
        "text": "Food is decent bar food, not fried. Inside is loud. Lots of TVs and the voices echo at the big open bar. Service was the worst. The lady seating is barely spoke, then was also our waitress. She mumbled and was not friendly, never did drink refills or check on the food.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
