    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 12296,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Andrea DeLong",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Such a fun place! Great atmosphere with nice views of the water to watch boats and birds. If you have a food allergy this place is for you! Was amazing all the precautions they take to ensure your food is prepared properly. Being gluten free made me feel at ease to eat here. Our waiter Christopher w",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Gina Leach",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We stopped at Lulu's for lunch.\nWe were greeted immediately and\nchose to sit at the bar. Definitely very casual with a costal vibe . They several tropical drinks to choose from i choose the hurricane and my boyfriend  had a local beer (FairHope).\nZach was our bartender/server. He was fantastic and v",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Candice McCall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We came here while visiting Gulf Shores and I'm so glad we did! The fried food was particularly good, including the crab claws (my family's favorite), the onion rings, and even the French fries were good! Our server was great with making recommendations, and we enjoyed the relaxing vibe. Next time w",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Becky Black",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "We're Visiting from Alaska. Excited about the experience. Food was meh... I was really excited to have some fried okra but it showed up soggy. Definitely not fried enough. Fish tacos were decent but got soggy quickly. Guacamole is delicious so cheers to chips and dip! Fried shrimp was the best. Didn",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melissa Hendrickson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Live music was great tonight!! Appetizers were good - best cheese dip and chips ever!! And the onion rings were phenomenal!! ❤️ We had fried chicken tenders and a grilled chicken tender meal, a  jumbo shrimp meal (which were good, but definitely not jumbo 🙃), also a hamburger with pepper jack cheese",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
