    "rating": 4.1,
    "reviews_count": 4572,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "William Wright",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Stopped by Mikee’s today because I heard a rumor about all you can eat crab legs… Well, it’s not a myth! Worth the wait?! ABSOLUTELY! And what they don’t tell ya and my server Desiree did; is that you can switch up and order on any other AYCE platter, cooked different ways, as well as sides. On the ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Britt",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "THE BEST “hometown” seafood in Gulf Shores. They are always our first stop for dinner when we come to Gulf Shores. All the food is in very generous portions and of high quality flavor. Family friendly atmosphere. Get there early on weekends or you will have to wait.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Timmi Otte",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Old school, casual atmosphere, polite and helpful staff and delicious, home cooked reasonably priced seafood. We got fried clams, gumbo with a house salad and shrimp salad. Homemade croutons and blue cheese dressing were delish!\nHighly recommend.",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rick Woodall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We ate main dining room before and enjoyed it but when it's crowded it's very noisy, went back and ate in the bar area at a high top table and ee enjoyed the atmosphere much more. Would recommend to go ahead and get the all you can eat crab legs, very flavorful and meaty.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Eunice Watters",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "I visited Mikee's Seafood during the last week of Mardi Gras while in Gulf Shores and were excited to try such a well-known local spot.\n\nUnfortunately, the service left a lot to be desired. Even the gentleman who seated us had a bit of an attitude, which set the tone for the visit. Our waitress seem",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
