    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Andrea Van Someren",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Arrived after a day at the beach and the place was pretty packed. Mostly people playing bingo, others enjoying their food. The girl at the counter was very welcoming and friendly. We ordered waters and when they gave us bottles, she said it was on them. For some reason that blew my mind in a little ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jessi Butler",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My family and I came here for the first time for lunch before flying out and we were pleasantly surprised by how great the food was! I myself got The Beach Bowl, which came with a large piece of grilled salmon, jasmine rice, and roasted cauliflower, zucchini, and squash all with an Asian Glaze on to",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Balloon Elevations",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love the atmosphere and subdued modern beach aesthetic! You order at the bar and choose your own seat. They have a well rounded menu & excellent flavor. We had the taco sampler and all 3 were delicious! My fav was the Mahi Mahi with shrimp in 2nd and chicken a close 3rd. The chips & salsa were givin",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ashley Morikawa",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Super cute, beachy place for some yummy drinks (alcoholic and non). There’s picnic tables on the porch and a couple swings with a kid area, more picnic tables down below the deck covered with umbrellas, and also plenty seating inside. Large variety of drinks, i tried one of the lemonade teas which w",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bryon Harris",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We visited this past August. This was our first time in the area and we wanted to try something local with a view.  The food was good.  I had the calamari and a grouper sandwich.  Mom had the fried Gulf shrimp basket.  We thought all three tasted great and were fresh.  I hope you like steps, because",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
