    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 51,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Gordon Wescoat",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We came for the soft grand opening.  We started off with appetizers including fried green tomatoes, the pub 6 shrimp, fried onions and pickles.  We also had the brisket burgerand the pickle Burger.  Everything was delicious. The service was incredible in the atmosphere was a lot of fun. Opening day ",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brig'ette Martin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "absolutely delicious. the boom boom shrimp, margarita, smash burger, and fries were phenomenal. not to mention thet have the only  Mac n cheese my kiddo will actually eat",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Britt Jacks",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Best wings at the beach! Loaded fries and brisket tacos were excellent too. Fully stocked bar, draft beer, $4 Miller Light pints. Tons of TV's to watch the games. Restaurant is in the same building as the Factory Trampoline Park, across from the Gulf Shores Sportsplex.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "JG",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a great local place.  For folks wanting great pub for food and drinks, this is it. Friendly staff and a great, calm vibe.  I ordered a Bloody Mary and the Brisket Tacos. Both were great. Very fast service and everyone in the place was laughing and having a good time.  If you're local or not, ch",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Reggie Pulliam",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great family place and sports bar. The brisket fries are simply incredible. Lots of TVs. Very affordable.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      }
    ],
