  {
    "place_id": "ChIJU9FrvUIbmogRPmIFMPDnpvo",
    "name": "S&S Seafood Market + Kitchen",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Gulf Shores",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "1154 W Beach Blvd, Gulf Shores, AL 36542, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-968-3474",
    "website": "http://seafoodbytheseashore.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.244791,-87.71634",
    "lat": 30.244791,
    "lng": -87.71634,
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 427,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Ella Spence",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Local! Local! Local! This place offers fresh caught fish and shrimp that they will cook on site for you. They also offer multiple different dips and salads. We really enjoyed our shrimp and Conecha sausage from here today. Enjoyed chatting with the cashier while we waited. Hopefully we can come back",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jasmine K",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is awesome!!! We ordered the largest family platter and fried snapper and it was delicious!! 6 pounds of boiled cajun shrimp with potatoes and corn was on point. Plus the sweet hot sauce and tartar sauce was so good too! First time trying snapper and it was so good and big filet! Not only",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "T Houston",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Every time I visit Gulf shores I always come here for food! When I say fresh, delicious and seasoned just right! We had the fried trigger fish, peel and eat shrimp, corn and hush puppies! This is a must go to place, carry out only.",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mike Nash",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Went to S&S because it was approaching 7pm and they were open til 8pm.  My wife and I picked up a pound of large shrimp and they let us do 1/2 fried and 1/2 steamed.  Simple and fantastic.  We saved a lot of money and time ordering from here rather than going out to eat.  The front person recommende",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Doug Taylor (DixieDoug)",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "(2023). Still one of my favorite places for Seafood!  This Spring, on 3 separate occasions, I've had the Royal Reds,Trigger Fish, and Fried Shrimp and Onion Rings. I've also had their wonderful Cucumber and Corn Salad, and Roasted Red Potatoes.  I think that I'll try the Grouper today with some more",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      }
    ],
