    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.3157468,-87.6764546",
    "lat": 30.3157468,
    "lng": -87.6764546,
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 20,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "John Reuss",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Took the family for brunch on Mother's day Saturday (because who wants to go out to brunch on Mother's day?). The burgers were excellent and reasonably priced. Good fries too. My wife got the shrimp & Grits. The shrimp was perfectly cooked but the grits were soupy. Service was solid. So, mostly good",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shawn Weaver",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Took students (13) and some parents (6) after a field trip.  Very accommodating and acted quick to host us without any notice. Food was good and the service was fantastic!",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
        "author": "Diane McCleery",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "This was one of the most disappointing restaurant experiences we’ve had in a long time. The service was chaotic from beginning to end. Our waitress repeatedly got orders wrong, forgot salad, soup, and sides, and even water took a long time to arrive after being requested.\n\nThe food quality was equal",
        "time": "a week ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "maegan",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is wonderful. A wide variety of dishes to choose from and amazing desserts to finish with! I will be back",
        "time": "a week ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amelia Fletcher",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Sat outside on a perfect night. Owner sang happy birthday to my friend in Italian…awesome voice and meal",
