  {
    "place_id": "ChIJAXYMZf3FkIgRRr_UYlJM4I0",
    "name": "Sneaky Tiki Bar",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Gulf Shores",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "17 Via De Luna Dr, Pensacola Beach, FL 32561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 850-466-8454",
    "website": "http://islandculturetikibar.com/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.3355151,-87.1365184",
    "lat": 30.3355151,
    "lng": -87.1365184,
    "rating": 4.7,
    "reviews_count": 411,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "J G",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is incredible. People are friendly and ages vary. Loved us 80's kids hanging with the young pups..Music is nice not too loud..Sunsets are beautiful and bar is flowing. Pretty bartenders make it that much nicer. Best place in Pensacola 🌴",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melinda Lee",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This was the best place in Pensacola I had so much fun. They have musical Bingo the people are very friendly and the drinks are so goooooodddddd.....You have got to check this place out they have a variety of people here not just ONE....\"You know what I mean?\"  I will definitely come back to Sneaky ",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Paul Davis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Loved it. Quaint little bar right on the water. Beach games. Super friendly staff",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Holly Williams (Chris & Holly)",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The Sneaky Tiki is such a fun beach-front bar! The whole setup is adorable — you can walk up or even boat up from the bay. The sand floor gives it that true beach vibe, and they’ve laid down sand pads along the paths which makes it easy to get around.\n\nThe seating options are awesome — they’ve got e",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Coastal Link Properties & Link Realty Gulf Coast",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Tiki on Pensacola Beach is a must-visit!\nAustin, the bartender, has one of the best personalities on the beach—he welcomes every customer with a fun, relaxed vibe that makes you feel right at home. The cocktails are fantastic, the atmosphere is unbeatable, and the bayside views of Pensaco",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      }
    ],
