      },
      {
        "author": "Lauren Shedeck",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The perfect pick me up after a fun day out. We had the double cheeseburger and Korean wings. Both were a 10 out of 10! Great atmosphere and service as well. Got the bill and realized we only spent $66 dollars including 2 beers and 2 specialty drinks! What a deal in this economy! Glad to have a great",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shane Moon",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great burgers and drinks.  Spicy Paloma is outstanding.",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly Johnson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great food and drinks in a great outdoor atmosphere.\n\nStaff is upbeat and friendly.   Burgers 🍔  are best around and they are open late.",
        "time": "in the last week"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dale Zimmer",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "In a world of burgers..especially at the beach, be different. And if you can’t be different- add salt and pepper to your patties. I don’t know. Use a little seasoning. You cook them well. You dress them well. But for the love of burgers, season your meat. Same for the fries. They can be as fresh as ",
        "time": "a week ago"
      }
    ],
