    "reviews_count": 61,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Chase Lambin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What an enjoyable experience. After a long day on the water, nothing hit the spot more than this pot of fresh seafood and veggies. It was simple, fun, and memorable. My family and I had a blast cracking crabs and lobsters and peeling shrimp. It was fun for the whole family, and delicious! I would re",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Chad Domingue",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Born and raised in Lafayette LA so I’ve done a ton of home seafood boils in my lifetime. Never has it been this easy.  Everything was really good and super easy to clean up. Would be easy to customize and add seasonings you wish if you like more spice than what is sent. I generally like very spicy b",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Stephen Chandler",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an absolutely amazing experience with Topsail Steamer — a true game changer for a vacation meal! The self-steam pot was not only easy and convenient, but it delivered restaurant-quality seafood right in the comfort of our own space. The combination of corn, potatoes, onions, peel-and-eat shri",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Baylee Carson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This was amazing! We were celebrating a birthday and it really made it a birthday to remember. It was an amazing experience from beginning to end. The staff was so kind and helpful through the whole process and made sure you had everything you needed. Very easy to follow instruction, and the seafood",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dianna Walraven",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "It is a take home and cook bucket. Not cooked in store. Just prepared for you. We thought it was a sit down place that cooked it for you due to pictures posted. But we went through with the experience anyways and it was absolutely delicious!!! Highly recommend if you have a stove to cook on. The you",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      }
    ],
