      {
        "author": "Andrew",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love it , there's bars and there's bars but this is a nice little bar, great people, fun to hang out shoot pool , for the price it's cheap and for the fun it is a 10/10 only wish they had darts but I love it . 2 people can drink beer all night and never run up a tab more than 20 bucks",
