      },
      {
        "author": "Jeff T",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Dedication, that’s what it takes to be open 7 days a week, 11am to 2am! This is a great stopping point outside of town.  It’s kind of like my basement, no rules, a little dirty, but cleaner than me. Diane (I think that’s right, this my third bar review today and it isn’t even 3pm) But I liked this f",
