  {
    "place_id": "ChIJEfMjbrQHmogRsI0euy-E4MA",
    "name": "Angry Crab Shack",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "25751 Perdido Beach Blvd #1-A, Orange Beach, AL 36561, USA",
    "phone": "+1 251-981-1136",
    "website": "https://www.angrycrabshack.com/perdido-blvd-orange-beach-al/",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.2715232,-87.58942449999999",
    "lat": 30.2715232,
    "lng": -87.58942449999999,
    "rating": 3.9,
    "reviews_count": 961,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Erin Poole",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "The food was amazing, a little overpriced though. Drinks were really good too. It was a busier night and I was a party of 1 but I felt that the service was a bit slow. Overall I had a great experience and I will be back when I am in the area!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jessica Callihan",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place was wonderful! We ordered gumbo and the jambalaya. It was good and spicy and extremely flavorful. The bread that came with it was delicious! The bartender Joe who waited on us, was super friendly and very attentive. We chose this place because it was the only place we could find in town t",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Sydney Cumbest",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I was there with a group of friends and all the food was really good and servers worked hard.  Oyster poor boy had tons of oysters! Batter was very flavorful and had more salt than I usually eat. Cajun fries good. Onion rings were even better! Live music was excellent! Dauphin Street Stompers dixiel",
        "time": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "clarence cooper",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First time there so I had to try the oysters in the half shell and they delivered. Very crowded and so very busy but our server was amazing and helpful. Food arrives as is is ready so nothing sits under a heat lamp. Prices and portions were both good. Will definitely be back.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "T Houston",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great food, great service! Food was Hot, fresh and delicious! We had the shrimp po boy- huge sandwich! Red beans rice were delicious and the fried shrimp basket! Will definitely come back again when I visit orange beach again!",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      }
    ],
