        "author": "Snarffel McGarlock",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great THANKSGIVING meal!!  We discovered this place today because of a facebook post, and oh!!!  It hit the spot!!! The staff was nice, the atmosphere is. CLEAN... ( LIKE THE OSMONDS WOULD YOU HERE) we have two kids and the staff was very helpful to accommodate them, the patrons were all nice... mos",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Carol Lengerman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Come for the food, stay for the view!\nNot a bad seat in the place, and the furniture is comfortable and allows you to stay and enjoy more food!\nAbsolutely start off with the Shrimp & Crab Dip.  There are locals who literally come here regularly just for this, and now we know why.  The Naan dippers a",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "D Lo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is fabulous.  JD was our waiter he went above and beyond waiting on us.  We had brunch there on Saturday, 5.00 Bloody Marys, prime rib with mashed potatoes and a blt with fried potatoes . Our bill came to 56.00 with the drinks, that’s crazy!! We enjoyed the heck out of the place. We could",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Coach Kenny",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "We had a great time at Barometer last night.  We sat on the second floor over looking the docks and the view was beautiful.  Our server was very attentive and made several suggestions for our meal.  The appetizer was the shrimp and crab dip which was tasty.  Our mains were good but honestly nothing ",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
