        "text": "Edited: since my post I have been in contact with management. They apologized for the service and lack of eggs. They have also offered  to make it up to us at another time. I appreciate management making  the time to make it right.\nOriginal: We made a reservation for brunch. A well advertised and re",
        "time": "9 months ago"
