    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Margarita Stamatelaky",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I am from California and wanted to try a local seafood  store.I came here and found the place on google and I am happy I did. The staff was friendly and loved the seafood display. I got delicious shrimp from the golf of Mexico and red snapper.",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Annie Girl",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Beautiful seafood market in Orange beach. Clean and loaded with fresh seafood and accoutrements! Prices were high, but that’s expected in February. Nonetheless, the fresh shrimp we bought & boiled were great! Friendly fast service!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "nick ciranni",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Excellent choices of fresh seafood. They can cook the fresh shrimp in a matter of minutes, and send you off with ice to keep them cold. If you want them cleaned, deveined and cooked you need to call an hour ahead. We took the cooked shell on shrimp with ice to the beach, topped it off with their exc",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jeff Hockin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We have been in OB for a month and their fish has been excellent! Great selection and friendly service. Highly recommend checking it out!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lee Baker",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The young man who waited on us was so nice.  He was a sophomore in HS and had a hurt arm.  He showed respect by saying Yes sir & no siret.  Same age as our grandson.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
