      },
      {
        "author": "Brian M",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "The service (Dwayne) was great.  The atmosphere was cool.  Old school, love that.  Issue is we had the shrimp (split it) and onion rings.  I have had fried shrimp but this one just seemed a bit greasier.  There was a grease aftertaste.  Nothing big, just aftertaste.  I have had other fried shrimp in",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mike Brown",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great place friendly and welcoming staff.  Food was excellent and came quickly.  I had fish, oysters, clams, crab, gumbo deep fried crab claws",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Joe Morrissey",
        "rating": 5,
