        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We checked this place out recently for dinner and had a great experience. Several people in our group of 7 tried the all-you-can-eat snow crab legs. It was $65 and each bucket came with 2 clusters. The first bucket comes with corn and potatoes. They also give you garlic bread. The crab legs were gre",
