        "text": "Tonight we had our Pop’s Celebration of Life at Hammered Crab in Gulf Shores! The night was absolutely perfect! Keith, our server was top notch! He had everyone’s drinks ready when we arrived. The tables were set up with candles and a table ready for us to display pictures. He did multiple drink ref",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
