        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Was definitely not the experience we were hoping for. 4 of the 5 people in our party were not impressed with their food. Just average. Nothing to write home about.\n\nOne of the other reviews stated that the smell of seafood was overwhelming and that is definitely correct. The hostess was unfriendly f",
