      {
        "author": "Michael Godshall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a wonderful visit at Junavelli winery.  The wine selections were delicious and there were many great gift ideas.  Roger and Lisa were very friendly.   It is amazing how much work they put into this winery.  I can't wait to visit again.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly Buick",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great place for an overnight stay. Pet friendly there is a lot of sand (like at the beach) and you will be parking in the sand. The owner is very nice and the wine is delicious. It is off the beaten path and I almost did not stay, but I did and the owner help with and phone call and assured me that ",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tara M.",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an absolutely wonderful experience at Junavelli Winery! Lisa was incredibly warm and welcoming, making us feel right at home. Our private tasting with her was fantastic—she guided us through an amazing selection of fruit wines, ranging from dry to sweet to delightfully indulgent. Every sip wa",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Eric Hofmann",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Roger and Lisa couldn't have been more hospitable Harvest Hosts. Loved their wines and their story. We wish them well.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
