        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great experience! Super friendly owner/wine maker and really good muscadine and fruit wines that have options for dry to sweet varieties. We were pleasantly surprised. The tasting he offered was generous, fun and informative. We will be back next time we're in the area! To top it all off, they're a ",
        "time": "a year ago"
      }
