    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Itsmoebby",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I went with two other people and it was really nice. The owners are very welcoming and the wine is also good. We tasted about 11 different ones and most of them were good. My favorite was the tropical love. We will definitely book again with more people.",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nikki Powell",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This winery is about 2.5 hours from our hometown and absolutely worth the visit. Owners were super friendly, wine was yummy and the atmosphere was beautiful. Definitely recommend!",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lakeysia Christian",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an amazing experience at LPV Winery. The staff was very friendly, very clean establishment, and the tour was extremely informative! Not to mention the great tasting wine!!!! I will definitely visit again for the beach scene and date night!!",
        "time": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "FAVOR'D W/ GRACE",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "It was such an amazing time!! The Ladies and I really enjoyed this location!!! Daniel and Rita showed us an awesome time. Everything was lovely The inside, the outside, the whole property itself is immaculate!!! This is a great place to go with your spouse, group of friends, family and/or your cowor",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tanya Grace",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "In one word- **INSPIRATIONAL**! From the tour to the tasting and everything in between this is truly an experience to remember. The owners take time to share the history of their business which is truly a labor of love. This intimate space is excellent for couples, families, groups or individuals. M",
        "time": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
