    "rating": 4.9,
    "reviews_count": 66,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Michael Calhoun",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We stopped by mostly out of curiosity, looking for something a little different for Valentine's Day, and we had a blast ! Wine and beer selections were great, live music and pizza were great, and the staff and patrons were so welcoming and friendly. We feel like we left with a lot of new friends. Th",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Luca Guazzotto",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Cute little place in Wedowee. We stopped out of curiosity and enjoyed their wheat beer (they also brew their own beers). As of now, they only have two brews. If they expand their selection I may rate them five stars. They also have a much wider selection of local wines. You can get samples and fligh",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Laura Morton",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My husband and I had a wonderful time at this winery. The wine selection was crazy and playful but most importantly delicious! The atmosphere was bright and relaxing. Scott (the wine maker?) Was really nice and super helpful while doing the wine tasting. At the end he gave us a tour. We will definit",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jane Windham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Absolutely loved this winery. We had a large family group for my mom's 60th birthday in town and I was looking for things to do. I called the winery to see if they could accommodate us and ended up speaking to the owner about the winery and the town for a solid 10 minutes! I always try to find a loc",
        "time": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Glue Guy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great day and a grand opening celebration.\nHand made crafted wines. From the usual to the unique. Serves wine only.  Told they are considering a cheese and meat board. Bring your own food if you want to sit and sip.\nFun atmosphere and decor to accent the history of the building.\nLimited open time fr",
        "time": "4 years ago"
      }
    ],
