    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Jeffrey Cowgill",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Fabulous brewery with a super staff and great selections.  The atmosphere is cool and doggie friendly Large garage doors open up to Palafox St.\n\nMy favorite experience is grabbing seats for the Mardi Gras parade and watching as it rolls by.  The beer line was never ending and ran out the door and do",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jrock",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "So sad/teary face.  I keep wanting to love this brewery. But, the beer just isn’t good.  Tried the grown up book fair today but there were way too many people let in at once for it to be fun.  Honestly I’ll probably keep trying because I love supporting local breweries, but a miss so far.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Coastal Link Properties & Link Realty Gulf Coast",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Odd Colony is the best brewery in town! You instantly feel that good energy when you walk through the door. The owners and staff are warm, welcoming and always greets you with a smile. The beer is the best in town and brewed with the finest ingredients and the atmosphere is well designed, cozy and c",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rebecca Berna",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place was so cool! Good beer, drinks and welcoming atmosphere. I love that they had Ryan and Meat Candy smoked meat as an addition on outside. His food is ALWAYS on point! Delicious and authentic. Wow!!! The real deal- succulent meat and  ribs!",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nomad",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Beers have great flavor, but a bit warm and lost effervescence. The ladies working there are great, but the flamboyant black dude working there should be fired immediately for terrible service. He ignored half the customers waiting to get a drink and was in a corner eating the entire time. Didn't ev",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
