        "author": "Leesa B",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "Would not recommend. Service was good. Food not so much. Husband got chili and said it was good. I order wing entree charred. They came out not charred and 6 wings instead of 8. My husband's Reuben was dry and not even grilled well. They also use plastic for there liquor and beer drinks. The atmosph",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tiena Hall",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our waiter Shane is amazing! We always had drinks and food. He is very friendly and always checked on us. He was extremely busy but always took the time to make sure we had everything we needed. Love the food and atmosphere! They accommodated us to watch the games we wanted to watch.  Great place!! ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kim Langham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The place is very inviting and family friendly. TVs on every wall, so you won’t miss your favorite team. Atmosphere is comfortable and friendly. Our server, Hunter, was polite and prompt with service. The menu has a little bit of everything. We tried the quesadilla and pretzels. Both were very good,",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kristin Mullenix",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The quality of food is great, fast service, our server Caroline was friendly and knowledgeable of the menu. I love the atmosphere. We can’t wait to try other items. Cute Merchandise !!!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      }
    ],
