    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviews_count": 299,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Alisa James",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My husband and I visited Ozan to celebrate our 6th wedding anniversary, and it was a wonderful experience from start to finish. We reserved the Brunch and Train Ride, and the entire visit was very relaxing and enjoyable.\n\nWe began where they started us off with Irish coffee and were given all the in",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Fanese Coleman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I've lived near this winery for years and finally decided to visit. I had a great experience at Ozan. The staff was very welcoming as soon as we walked through the door. We went on a Saturday morning for the wine tasting and train ride. The wines and pairings were great. This is great for a girls' d",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ashley Macon",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "Great experience! The yellow whiskey before the train ride was good but the train ride was a tad boring but still a good experience overall especially if you’ve never ridden a train before. The wine tasting was excellent with 10 different wines. The cheese plate/ charcuterie board was filling and ta",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christopher S",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "This place is pretty cool and worth a visit if you’re in the area. The wine is delicious, with a variety of types/flavors and the bottles are price very reasonably. The food is good as well but not exceptional. The staff are all very kind and accommodating. The tour itself is very short and basicall",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dane Wetterer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This place is awesome. It's such a neat setting, such a beautiful area, and they have wonderful spots for indoor and outdoor seating.  There wine was fantastic, I had a flight and a glass and no complaints on anything I tried. I also tried a little bit of their spirits and they were also fantastic, ",
        "time": "4 years ago"
      }
    ],
