    "name": "Perfect Plain Brewing Co.",
    "category": "specialty",
    "city": "Orange Beach",
    "state": "AL",
    "address": "50 E Garden St, Pensacola, FL 32502, USA",
    "phone": "",
    "website": "http://perfectplain.com/home",
    "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.4133923,-87.2139444",
    "lat": 30.4133923,
    "lng": -87.2139444,
    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 473,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Rikki Vidak",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We held my daughter’s wedding reception in the Garden and Grain Room. It was perfect! Jayden and her staff were so easy to work with, they were with us all the way. It’s easy to decorate. Catering options are convenient. The place is wired for blue tooth which allowed us to play our own music. Just ",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Morgan Hayes",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Perfect Plain is seriously one of my favorite spots. The bartenders are so nice and genuinely fun to talk to, and they really know what they are doing. If you ask for a recommendation, they actually listen and make something you will love.\n\nThe vibe is just as good as the drinks. It is cozy, welcomi",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Marlonski Brando",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Most breweries in Pensacola close at 10 pm. The fact that they're open until midnight on Thursday and 1 am on Friday and Saturday is 5-stars for me! I only had their lime lager on my quick visit, which tasted good.",
        "time": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christopher Gugel",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Love this brewery! Great beers, friendly staff, and chill vibes. Highly recommend a stop in to see what they’ve got on tap!",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bill Sikora",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Such a cool brewery conveniently located right near all of the good stuff in  downtown Pensacola, FL. Our bartender Stephanie was super helpful in helping us choose beers that we would like, and their merch selection was great! Definitely a brewery that I would love to visit again!",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      }
    ],
