    "rating": 4.5,
    "reviews_count": 381,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Dana",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came here late Saturday night for the first time since the new owner took over. Definitely has a friendlier vibe, and more cocktail options than before (so\nGlad they serve Prosecco now). Staff and patrons were super nice and friendly. Owner talked to us a bit too and was also really nice. Will defin",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shawn White",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I can't believe I haven't left a review of this place yet! We love Scuttlebutt. Nearly always a good vibe. Great conversations with the bartenders and other patrons. It's like cheers, everyone leaves as friends.\n\nWe've been multiple times over the past 2 years. Recently, the new bartender Sam has be",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Scott Honeycutt",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great local hangout. Excellent bartenders. Small but has that “where everybody knows your name “ atmosphere. They have started serving food but the kitchen was closed when I was there",
        "time": "a year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "MrsThorne",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Came to Scuttlebutt Pub on St. Patrick's Day  and we don't regret it! There was 9 of us and Marty was so accommodating! She made us feel at home, made sure the drinks were flowing and the food was amazing! The atmosphere was perfect for us, we all agreed that this was the place we wanted to come and",
        "time": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Aaron mason",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Really good place to grab a beer and just relax.  Great service and bartenders. The owner is an amazing person.  Pool tables are good as well.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
