    "rating": 4.6,
    "reviews_count": 75,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Snow Gypsies Travelers",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is a Beautiful Vineyard!! we did their Tasting which was $20  for five glasses of wine 🍷 we also ordered their Charcuterie Board. This is a Beautiful Place a lot of outdoor & indoor seating, Excellent Service, just Gorgeous all in all, Great Place to Go !!😍",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Marissa Sweazy Klaassen",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I can’t say enough positive things about Southern Grove. The wine flight was amazing, the food was delicious, the service was phenomenal (shoutout to our server Kat!) and oh my - the grounds were full of picture perfect backdrops for those insta-worthy photos.\n\nThe seating outside is something from ",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dana",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "Came here for a somatic yoga class and decided to grab wine and food after. The wine was okay (super limited and really random selection of reds, which is puzzling since we’re entering the colder months), the food was awful. We ordered the margherita flatbread and received a soggy piece of bread smo",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Barbara Williams",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Beautiful surprise! Visited with a friend for a tasting, and thought every wine we tried was exceptional. Sarah, our server, was warm and welcoming. We ordered 2 deserts to take away, but ended up leaving without them because we were chatting with staff, and completely forgot. We were staying in Gul",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Katherine Alsup",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We hosted my grandfather’s 90th birthday party here on a Saturday evening, and it turned out perfect! The setting was beautiful, the food was fantastic, and the service was top-notch. We ordered the Grand Harvest Board along with their pimento cheese and sliders—everything was delicious and beautifu",
        "time": "10 months ago"
      }
    ],
