    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Chris Washington",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The absolute best chili dogs I've ever eaten!!! The fries and onion rings are incredible too! Great staff and nice clean environment!!! Definitely going back soon!!! 5 stars all day long!!",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Itzel Avitia",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The food was made fresh, the cashier was so sweet and kind, I saw her answer questions about the menu to the guests in front of us with a smile and kindness. The food came out so fast and the fries and onions rings are GOOD. The burgers are GOOD too with amazing presentation.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "J D",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great food, friendly service, and a chill atmosphere that makes me want to stay longer. Everything felt easy and welcoming, and meeting Thomas was a awesome, genuinely cool guy. Easy 5/5 and would definitely come back.",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "David Brown",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Everything was delicious. I am the only one in our party that got the chips. They were great.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "onlyone Sanchez",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great customer service,  food was awesome.  Definitely have to try the Tiki fries",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      }
