    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Harry & Mary Varner",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Highly Recommend this restaurant, the food was delicious. We went during Happy Hour and was pleasantly surprised. We had fresh Margaritas made from scratch. All Appetizers $6 I had the Fried Flounder w/ff and Pineapple coleslaw for $10.95 the atmosphere was great we sat on the patio. The customer se",
        "time": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Andrea Van Someren",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our server was very sweet, gave us plenty of space, but also there if we needed her. We arrived after a long drive, so it was about an 1.5 hours before closing, and they didn’t make us feel like we were inconveniencing them, by showing up when we did. The Sunday special was delicious and definitely ",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Curtis Cunnyngham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Spinach and artichoke dip was amazing with the pita chips. Chicken strip dinner was amazing. It was tender, juicy, and had the best crumb. Hands down best! Crawfish Mac and cheese was seasoned just right with just enough spice mixed with the cheese was phenomenal. Bayley was our waiter and he was th",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brian M",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great place for happy hour (that's when we went).  $3 domestic Drafts, $4.00 domestic bottles and cans.  $6 appetizers.  Sat at the bar good bartender(s).  We will definitely be going back.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Stainless 921",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Ordered take out tonight because we didn't have time for a sit down meal. Anytime we visit The Beach House, service, food and atmosphere is always great. You get plenty of food per meal and at a reasonable price. Highly recommended for take out or dining in.",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      }
    ],
