        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an absolutely outstanding experience! The seafood was incredible—fresh, perfectly cooked, and full of flavor. The restaurant itself is beautiful, and the entire staff was welcoming and attentive. Josie was our waiter and truly made the night special—friendly, knowledgeable, and on point with ",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Maddy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I ate the Creole Blackend Red fish dinner with buttered garlic broccoli. The fish and sauce were amazing! The broccoli didn’t have much flavor but was refreshing! I loved my dinner. We went beginning of March, so there was zero wait time and the vibes are great. Staff was very kind, especially KAYLA",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
