        "text": "This is one of our favor restaurants in Gulf Shores! You’ve got to check it out! Overall great atmosphere from the moment you step foot inside until you leave. The customer service is great and the food is even better! Very family friendly. Easy access to the parking lot. I had the fresh catch of th",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
