    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Juliana_banana",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "This was our second time going and we really enjoyed it. I’m not from around here so finding good places to eat at while here is always fun! We started out with the fried green tomato’s and they were delicious, however the cheese sauce served with them felt like cheesy soup. We’d recommend getting t",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Don Rutledge",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our first time visiting Orange Beach,we tried two different seafood restaurants and the third seafood restaurant was Wolf Bay, the food was  awesome,we liked it so much we came back the next day also. I have seen people post reviews about being expensive, if you are looking to spend under $30 for tw",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amanda Major",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Wolf Bay is a Baldwin County restaurant rite of passage. I was a regular there with my family throughout the 80s and 90s, back when they served green beans with every meal. 🍤 Their Orange Beach location is on the faux water, a small lake on Perdido Beach Blvd, right across the Highway from the Gulf.",
        "time": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Joye Hehn",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Clean, bright, fresh decor and quick, friendly service set the stage for a great meal! We enjoyed fresh oysters, salad bar and tasty entrees. The three of us all had something different--each was pleased with our choices. Service with Tayiah was fantastic! We did not feel rushed, but she hustled fro",
        "time": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jaz",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "A pretty good restaurant. I visited for the first time this month while in town for work and vacation. I followed signs to the outside patio and waited for a hostess to seat me. I had to flag someone down to be seated, which wasn’t a good impression. I was finally seated and greeted by the server af",
        "time": "6 months ago"
      }
