        "author": "ServingHimWherever",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Amazing experience Chelsea was great but  so was the rest of the team. One critique the price of the meal and the money they make and to put the CC charge back on me I think was a tacky move. Many team members came to out table and were very conversational and interested in our experience. And the f",
