      },
      {
        "author": "Jessica & Casey Duhe",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Last year we had Avery as our server, and she was absolutely incredible. Her kindness and attention to detail set the bar so high that the marina, the breeze, the food, and her service became a memory we wanted to turn into a tradition.\n\nThis year, Lindsey took such beautiful care of us. She, the st",
        "time": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bob Indelicato",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "From the moment we walked in, the atmosphere was incredible and the service was genuinely warm and welcoming. Avery and Justice made our anniversary celebration one of the most memorable experiences we’ve had. Their attention and kindness made us feel like family, not just another table. We highly r",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Paula Roberts",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Wow! We were blown away with the service, care of my allergy needs (Celiacs), atmosphere, views, and delicious food at Zeke's. Julia was by far one of the best servers we have ever encountered. She made my birthday dinner even more special. So personal, sweet, kind and attentive,  a true delight! We",
        "time": "2 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shannon Wheatley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Zeke’s is so good on its own but RONNA made it perfect! She should be a hospitality manager!! Attentive to our group of 20 people, she was just amazing. The food was so good too. They cooked the fish that our husbands caught that day on a boat of their marina. I will definitely be back.",
        "time": "2 months ago"
